 updates in the /core/examples/luigi-example-angular directory: [@angular/common](https://github.com/angular/angular/tree/HEAD/packages/common) and [@angular/core](https://github.com/angular/angular/tree/HEAD/packages/core).\n\n\nUpdates `@angular/common` from 21.2.19 to 21.2.20\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/angular/angular/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/v21.2.20/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/angular/angular/commits/v21.2.20/packages/common)\n\nUpdates `@angular/core` from 21.2.19 to 21.2.20\n- [Release notes](https://github.com/angular/angular/releases)\n- [Changelog](https://github.com/angular/angular/blob/v21.2.20/CHANGELOG.md)\n- [Commits](https://github.com/angular/angular/commits/v21.2.20/packages/core)\n\n---\nupdated-dependencies:\n- dependency-name: \"@angular/common\"\n  dependency-version: 21.2.20\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  dependency-group: npm_and_yarn\n- dependency-name: \"@angular/core\"\n  dependency-version: 21.2.20\n  dependency-type: direct:production\n  dependency-group: npm_and_yarn\n...\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\n\n* Update core/examples/luigi-example-angular/package.json\n\nSigned-off-by: Philipp Pracht <philipp.pracht@sap.com>\n\n* bump other ng pkgs\n\nSigned-off-by: hardl <philipp.pracht@sap.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: dependabot[bot] <support@github.com>\nSigned-off-by: Philipp Pracht <philipp.pracht@sap.com>\nSigned-off-by: hardl <philipp.pracht@sap.com>\nCo-authored-by: dependabot[bot] <49699333+dependabot[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>\nCo-authored-by: Philipp Pracht <philipp.pracht@sap.com>","tree":{"sha":"4ff31f778521a851c774a839753e533d3ec74bd1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luigi-project/luigi/git/trees/4ff31f778521a851c774a839753e533d3ec74bd1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/luigi-project/luigi/git/commits/e29688a24a7ace312c18d08763f8b20a85a42ac6","verification":{"payload":"tree 4ff31f778521a851c774a839753e533d3ec