wing_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnsonm325/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnsonm325/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/johnsonm325","id":15373136,"login":"johnsonm325","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE1MzczMTM2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnsonm325/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnsonm325/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnsonm325/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnsonm325/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnsonm325/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/johnsonm325","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-inventory-frontend/commits/9005d4d95b387ce110e3149f7e3b66a3339c1dc9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T18:21:31Z","email":"micjohns@redhat.com","name":"Michael Johnson"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T18:21:31Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(RHINENG-30443): active view id in url (#3596)\n\nWhat\n\nAdds default view resolution and URL stamping to the Inventory Views feature. When navigating to /insights/inventory with no view_id query parameter (fresh landing or old bookmark), the app now:\n\n1. Resolves the default view (currently the \"All systems\" system view)\n2. Stamps view_id into the URL so a refresh restores the correct view\n3. Preserves any existing filter params (dirty default view survives refresh)\n4. Handles stale/deleted view IDs gracefully (falls back to default, keeps filters)\n\nWhy\n\nUser pain addressed:\n\nBefore this change, navigating to /insights/inventory without a view_id would load the All Systems view correctly, but refreshing the page with filters applied would:\n- Restore the filters (persisted in URL)\n- Show the wrong view ID in state (all-systems sentinel instead of the real UUID)\n- Create a mismatch between what''s shown and what''s active\n\nForward compatibility:\n\nBackend PR #4903 introduces user-pinned default views via get_default_view_id(org_id, user_id). This PR structures the frontend to slot in that resolution later — one clear swap point (resolveDefaultViewId) that today falls back to the system view and can later prefer a user''s pinned default.\n\nManual verification:\n\n1. /insights/inventory → stamps view_id=<system-view-uuid>\n2. /insights/inventory?status=stale → stamps view_id + keeps status=stale\n3. Refresh with view_id + filters → preserves both\n4. Deleted view ID in URL → falls back to default, keeps filters","tree":{"sha":"372e9d5e64aeb14e947a3e420a38edd6e981d2b8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-inventory-frontend/git/trees/372e9d5e64aeb14e947a3e420a38edd6e981d2b8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/insights-inventory-frontend/git/commits/9005d4d95b387ce110e3149f7e3b66a3339c1dc9","verification":{"payload":"tree 372e9d5e64aeb14e947a3e420a38edd6e981d2b8\nparent 840ac72a056a2863a2f58d63d1a70bafca4b27d5\nauthor Michael Johnson <micjohns@redhat.com> 1789669291 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789669291 -0400\n\nfeat(RHINENG-30443): active view id in url (#3596)\n\nWhat\n\nAdds default view resolution and URL stamping to the Inventory Views feature. When navigating to /insights/inventory with no view_id query parameter (fresh landing or old bookmark), the app now:\n\n1. Resolves the default view (currently the \"All systems\" system view)\n2. Stamps view_id into the URL so a refresh restores the correct view\n3. Preserves any existing filter params (dirty default view survives refresh)\n4. Handles stale/deleted view IDs gracefully (falls back to default, keeps filters)\n\nWhy\n\nUser pain addressed:\n\nBefore this change, navigating to /insights/inventory without a view_id would load the All Systems view correctly, but refreshing the page with filters applied would:\n- Restore the filters (persisted in URL)\n- Show the wrong view ID in state (all-systems sentinel instead of the real UUID)\n- Create a mismatch between what''s shown and what''s active\n\nForward compatibility:\n\nBackend PR #4903 introduces user-pinned default views via get_default_view_id(org_id, user_id). This PR structures the frontend to slot in that resolution later — one clear swap point (resolveDefaultViewId) that today falls back to the system view and can later prefer a user''s pinned default.\n\nManual verification:\n\n1. /insights/inventory → stamps view_id=<system-view-uuid>\n2. /insights/inventory?status=stale → stamps view_id + keeps status=stale\n3. Refresh with view_id + filters → preserves both\n4. Deleted view ID in URL → falls back to default, keeps filters","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrC+rCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAfu4QAHAHDQAkKLkyS+l9uDhUxVWq\nIxXnzzHCJk5MMjeFezEHONRQ9MA3JzDNTPOW23qqvYu3haK68ZvKNG7aixzTxRqr\n1bBceiumAzAV69PaLg6vWhN2RJbHWFDnsaxDuK9GFgVHNxgIR5Uwd4sGrjwjP3IC\ngYjfNksQN/QPHdiEHc4XKfzs19wnuJrculNb10Xf0rCCzdwVPRdaUC4RqygvRNKB\nbtXyrIhcDFQk9wxXU7910WF7g/dnILiJYZeIxEey04mtcv7xqyYRa+qfK/q2IMpj\nTIC/9sr+Fm44/E6xlXJHm51RhufmJ91DJGYBZru/BOQjlJYtbuH6CGJfslS21f4q\nWkJYjkU5WWJhS3XX7EH80crIUHdhIBEdZhvSfgQgodW6Nzk1mSkLWqPJYCO8uTgV\n0F9Qpn2EzcjdxYn3d9tRHmbQZtoEhkitLEzPRaydvxV5+uJ4PdiXM+y9vDLwKXMk\nZHOsaixIoXOwZVvBKaFEi4nnzAaw2yWriodNv4B774DEJhPdeF8o0PbfYEL1zY7m\nVq/XAfdFeT94vvUOl2EcoI+7m0kC8GfSv1p2qcgfM7/45osTv6td1eRFV/UlIBfC\nY4YiKC/CY/vrW1EQoOLbDyucNhk61WL2mvuDIA9bhKD36CNMWRCgP6lNrz4Za2Wz\nDuvl87Q5KaHMp5vgXcNp\n=bKxn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-17T18:21:31Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/oth