SchweizerischeBundesbahnen/scion-workbench/commits/6d8590c342f4e1698b7e9335c8f02338ef6b7ba2"}],"sha":"67b95eaac7d7ebb65d1a327ca79077c7ac8dfbf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SchweizerischeBundesbahnen/scion-workbench/commits/67b95eaac7d7ebb65d1a327ca79077c7ac8dfbf8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7974299?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielwiehl/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielwiehl/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielwiehl/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielwiehl/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/danielwiehl","id":7974299,"login":"danielwiehl","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc5NzQyOTk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielwiehl/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielwiehl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielwiehl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielwiehl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielwiehl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielwiehl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SchweizerischeBundesbahnen/scion-workbench/commits/6d8590c342f4e1698b7e9335c8f02338ef6b7ba2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-01-13T10:23:02Z","email":"daniel.wiehl@yahoo.com","name":"danielwiehl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-01-19T14:44:30Z","email":"marc.muster@bluewin.ch","name":"Marc Muster"},"message":"feat(workbench): enable host app to contribute microfrontends for parts and views\n\nHost applications can now contribute microfrontends for workbench parts and views. Like regular parts and views, microfrontends of the host app can inject `WorkbenchPart` and `WorkbenchView` from `@scion/workbench` to interact with the part or view.\n\nHost microfrontends require an empty path. In the route, use the `canMatchWorkbenchPartCapability` or `canMatchWorkbenchViewCapability` guard to match the part or view capability.\n\nExample — Route matching a part capability with qualifier `{part: ''navigator''}`\n```ts\nimport {Routes} from ''@angular/router'';\nimport {canMatchWorkbenchPartCapability} from ''@scion/workbench'';\n\nconst routes: Routes = [\n  {path: '''', canMatch: [canMatchWorkbenchPartCapability({part: ''navigator''})], component: NavigatorComponent},\n];\n```\n\nExample — Route matching a view capability with qualifier `{view: ''search''}`\n```ts\nimport {Routes} from ''@angular/router'';\nimport {canMatchWorkbenchViewCapability} from ''@scion/workbench'';\n\nconst routes: Routes = [\n  {path: '''', canMatch: [canMatchWorkbenchViewCapability({view: ''search''})], component: SearchComponent},\n];\n```\n\nHost microfrontends can inject `ActivatedMicrofrontend` to access the capability and passed parameters.\n\nExample — inject `ActivatedMicrofrontend` in a host microfrontend to read capability and parameters:\n```ts\nimport {inject} from ''@angular/core'';\nimport {ActivatedMicrofrontend} from ''@scion/workbench'';\n\nconst {capability, params} = inject(ActivatedMicrofrontend);\n```\n\ncloses #271\n\nBREAKING CHANGE:\n- Dialog, popup, and messagebox microfrontends of the host application now require an empty path.\n  To migrate, set the path in the capability to an empty string and use the new route matchers `canMatchWorkbenchDialogCapability`, `canMatchWorkbenchPopupCapability`, or `canMatchWorkbenchMessageBoxCapability`, respectively.\n\n  Example — route matching a dialog capability with qualifier `{dialog: ''about''}`\n  ```ts\n  import {Routes} from ''@angular/router'';\n  import {canMatchWorkbenchDialogCapability} from ''@scion/workbench'';\n\n  const routes: Routes = [\n    {path: '''', canMatch: [canMatchWorkbenchDialogCapability({dialog: ''about''})], component: AboutComponent},\n  ];\n  ```\n\n  Since the path must be empty, capability parameters cannot be referenced in the path anymore.\n  To migrate, inject `ActivatedMicrofrontend` in the microfrontend component to read the passed parameters.\n\n  Example — inject `ActivatedMicrofrontend` in a host microfrontend to read capability and parameters:\n  ```ts\n  import {inject} from ''@angular/core'';\n  import {ActivatedMicrofrontend} from ''@scion/workbench'';\n\n  const {capability, params} = inject(ActivatedMicrofrontend);\n  ```\n- Host dialog microfrontends must now inject `WorkbenchDialog` from `@scion/workbench` (previously from `@scion/workbench-client`).\n- Host messagebox microfrontends must now inject `WorkbenchDialog` from `@scion/workbench` (previously from `@scion/workbench-client`).\n- Host popup microfrontends must now inject `WorkbenchPopup` from `@scion/workbench` (previously from `@scion/workbench-client`).\n- Host popup microfrontends can read deprecated referrer information from the deprecated `WORKBENCH_POPUP_REFERRER` DI token (previously from `WorkbenchClient`).\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: SCION Workbench requires `@scion/workbench-client` version `1.0.0-beta.37` or later.","tree":{"sha":"7f4bc0a43c649e04850cf8a97758cdf69b633584","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SchweizerischeBundesbahnen/scion-workbench/git/trees/7f4bc0a43c649e04850cf8a97758cdf69b633584"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SchweizerischeBundesbahnen/scion-workbench/git/commits/6d8590c342f4e1698b7e9335c8f02338ef6b7ba2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25194435?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marcarrian/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marcarrian/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marcarrian/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marcarrian/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Marcarr