.github.com/users/danielwiehl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SchweizerischeBundesbahnen/scion-workbench/commits/55e451fb0646683742092a7ae50476e180079fe5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-27T09:29:32Z","email":"daniel.wiehl@yahoo.com","name":"danielwiehl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-27T13:45:03Z","email":"marc.muster@bluewin.ch","name":"Marc Muster"},"message":"refactor(workbench-client/notification): refactor Workbench Notification API\n\nRefactored the Workbench Notification API to align with other Workbench APIs like Dialog, MessageBox, and Popup.\n\ncloses #479\n\nDEPRECATION: Refactored the Workbench Notification API to align with other Workbench APIs like Dialog, MessageBox, and Popup. Deprecated the old API and marked it for removal.\n\nTo migrate:\n- Pass text or qualifier as the first argument to `WorkbenchNotificationService.show`.\n- Set duration in milliseconds, not seconds.\n- Renamed `WorkbenchNotificationConfig` to `WorkbenchNotificationOptions`.","tree":{"sha":"eb84774a605c911fb6c10d5e1084f9c6205aebc3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SchweizerischeBundesbahnen/scion-workbench/git/trees/eb84774a605c911fb6c10d5e1084f9c6205aebc3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SchweizerischeBundesbahnen/scion-workbench/git/commits/55e451fb0646683742092a7ae50476e180079fe5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25194435?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marcarrian/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marcarrian/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marcarrian/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marcarrian/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Marcarrian","id":25194435,"login":"Marcarrian","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI1MTk0NDM1","organizations_url":"h