.github.com/users/danielwiehl/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielwiehl/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielwiehl/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielwiehl/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/danielwiehl","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SchweizerischeBundesbahnen/scion-workbench/commits/57c5406c38f270f95a91edd32d607598e524cf40/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2025-11-26T10:25:41Z","email":"daniel.wiehl@yahoo.com","name":"danielwiehl"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2025-11-27T13:45:03Z","email":"marc.muster@bluewin.ch","name":"Marc Muster"},"message":"refactor(workbench-client/popup): refactor Workbench Popup API\n\nRefactored the Workbench Popup API to align with other Workbench APIs like Dialog, MessageBox, and Notification.\n\ncloses #479\n\nDEPRECATION: Refactored the Workbench Popup API to align with other Workbench APIs like Dialog, MessageBox, and Notification. Deprecated the old API and marked it for removal.\n\nTo migrate:\n- Changed signature of `WorkbenchPopup.params` from `Map<string, any>` to `Map<string, unknown>`. An explicit cast may be required now.\n- Renamed `WorkbenchPopupConfig` to `WorkbenchPopupOptions`.\n\nBREAKING CHANGE: Removed generic from popup handle as not required on type-level.","tree":{"sha":"6a6d63f4b4f28284a9946f6dfedb844e31e651b2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SchweizerischeBundesbahnen/scion-workbench/git/trees/6a6d63f4b4f28284a9946f6dfedb844e31e651b2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/SchweizerischeBundesbahnen/scion-workbench/git/commits/57c5406c38f270f95a91edd32d607598e524cf40","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/25194435?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Marcarrian/events{/pri