ply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(deps): pin vulnerable transitive deps to patched versions (#21)\n\nClears all open Dependabot security alerts (dev/build tooling):\n- root: js-yaml resolution ^4.1.1 -> ^4.2.0 (resolves 4.3.0); @babel/core\n  refreshed to 7.29.7\n- tests: add qs ^6.15.2 and uuid ^11.1.1 resolutions; js-yaml 3.x -> 3.15.0\n\nVerified: full Cypress suite green (23/23).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"175830e11035a7ef698a9d3b68dac24a034dffe0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/git/trees/175830e11035a7ef698a9d3b68dac24a034dffe0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/git/commits/d83bdb81829c6d13c4c1487b725f236c421c99f3","verification":{"payload":"tree 175830e11035a7ef698a9d3b68dac24a034dffe0\nparent ac8e52a0dbd01e19806de111a5a96785885037fb\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1783522675 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1783522675 +0200\n\nfix(deps): pin vulnerable transitive deps to patched versions (#21)\n\nClears all open Dependabot security alerts (dev/build tooling):\n- root: js-yaml resolution ^4.1.1 -> ^4.2.0 (resolves 4.3.0); @babel/core\n  refreshed to 7.29.7\n- tests: add qs ^6.15.2 and uuid ^11.1.1 resolutions; js-yaml 3.x -> 3.15.0\n\nVerified: full Cypress suite green (23/23).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqTmVzCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAaMcQAD/LWCQRgZCQzRo15jw+hZrh\nqxolZ54ODEV4chQ5dLXxljSCPUhfVMamx7nVkTujwR48sV1oKW4Pva+Qas1SS677\n31Y/4HX+qZ/lInmfLaSLKYZElIVxlsQGefanC3LhpXt6rkw6yjU0N4ZunhHZMznR\noWjyXqdMxHR5e3IV6x8HxqFt9Ydjcc4JUXLbWNm0COdz7sn4oh0lq1RbkMehkSQq\nhCtKo5dMXBO5DEAy9iBxLfuGpk2Q7FAPBlIev+QbuPmj5mXmh6dp3DynKIIVdAHx\nqYhhLMElYbT0WNx5IerFbDULO13kwkm2u4BbyVzB4wpjUgJmwNTtWZTULQ3d+FCg\nxgEuhmYk3UVim27igvo3YMLRDvM6uHsrFHFKVG4R1ZsjuaD29CIlV8VOEGwrJoGx\nu1Z+NuJ3SAUYxP2ufbZ6Pa/PAJ9GDEfRNCfKB4sg/pY6DUbmmeA73mhNCplH