vents_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commit/75730bd5f9d77e6365587f94c42916519b100dc6","node_id":"C_kwDOCHvMzdoAKDc1NzMwYmQ1ZjlkNzdlNjM2NTU4N2Y5NGM0MjkxNjUxOWIxMDBkYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commit/e692b08df32f1179afc92ae381147590fe89cbc6","sha":"e692b08df32f1179afc92ae381147590fe89cbc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commits/e692b08df32f1179afc92ae381147590fe89cbc6"}],"sha":"75730bd5f9d77e6365587f94c42916519b100dc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commits/75730bd5f9d77e6365587f94c42916519b100dc6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commits/e692b08df32f1179afc92ae381147590fe89cbc6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-30T08:34:08Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-30T08:34:08Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: import org.jahia.taglibs.jcr.node so the view JSP renders (#18)\n\nThe view JSP for jnt:full_read_only_notifier calls the EL function\njcr:getChildrenOfType, implemented by org.jahia.taglibs.jcr.node.JCRTagUtils.\nmaven-bundle-plugin (bnd) derives Import-Package from bytecode only and does\nnot scan JSPs, so this package was never imported. At render time the compiled\nJSP servlet could not resolve the TLD function class, producing:\n\n  JasperException: org.jahia.taglibs.jcr.node.JCRTagUtils not found by\n  full-read-only-notifier\n\nAdd the package explicitly to Import-Package (keeping the !org.jsoup.*\nexclusion) so the bundle gets an OSGi wire to the Jahia-exported package.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"af47a37985e1367dea21cf3133bba060010a2f05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/git/trees/af47a37985e1367dea21cf3133bba060010a2f05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/git/commits/e692b08df32f1179afc92ae381147590fe89cbc6","verification":{"payload":"tree af47a37985e1367dea21cf3133bba060010a2f05\nparent 6edc07e86ca824d95f9e806a0c1f7e7fd47c757d\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782808448 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782808448 +0200\n\nfix: import org.jahia.taglibs.jcr.node so the view JSP renders (#18)\n\nThe view JSP for jnt:full_read_only_notifier calls the EL function\njcr:getChildrenOfType, implemented by org.jahia.taglibs.jcr.node.JCRTagUtils.\nmaven-bundle-plugin (bnd) derives Import-Package from bytecode only and does\nnot scan JSPs, so this package was never imported. At render time the compiled\nJSP servlet could not resolve the TLD function class, producing:\n\n  JasperException: org.jahia.taglibs.jcr.node.JCRTagUtils not found by\n  full-read-only-notifier\n\nAdd the package explicitly to Import-Package (keeping the !org.jsoup.*\nexclusion) so the bundle gets an OSGi wire to the Jahia-exported package.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqQ3+ACRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXIYQABUkext1cVTyS0UXiQCwJHr8\nMMSCQRDeaNENgTGQvmRCgT+Oy24BZWfpWsMuMi98kw4BPrnriDRWFitaSAOBpmqB\nSe1U4REdjlAN60hmCamlIU/VKtrW9Oc25b3bLVSmxoZPDv6lXz931JnT6/jtmqHd\nq1pt7aXI1hqDj1B/6nz+jtQHI1Xmm1b3xyISAQWYKc+oOT4leak96oHNCLQ8xNf4\nEvYpVNByDDactF6TtkZU/OOQPHH4YwFo4jWxq4ro/fXBGEB0cSEfGtNglW2rNcYF\nmmLTb3IOswCOBoxwNIMa5t7RioKIB8w1X3LfyrSjtcQFEDQOhiorqNKqmfuQOq3J\nS8xVR+6xE6NfEHCON0skE0txmNGZmWj2B0aqWo4Mvk3OJVYD45Id5ctBBOZ4N5ZU\nvhorTzHLWwTcRLX+6ttmeBaxDFIlfQ6bxZ6MolT2ib+mJPkt3f82/GZgsfc2Y8Bb\nMUggHPJrvKXWEQ4D+w1oRlq2OvqOwqAj8vCtUX+QM6l9piD6Ri50VZWb6M6696lw\nbN1ek+f9mlnjdEheyf3kX/OdAQmnnRi1CSue8+tRvx4zUApPT4lbRhIJUTzrzLSl\nm3Nu6C4O5FNxnuadhnavSi/bMaaXuJ8jllteiR8c56qOg/av7NZ2zJxxsaXTZ+Rm\n9KN+4wVhEd3EOrh4CHGQ\n=wx3H\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-30T08:34:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commit/e692b08df32f1179afc92ae381147590fe89cbc6","node_id":"C_kwDOCHvMzdoAKGU2OTJiMDhkZjMyZjExNzlhZmM5MmFlMzgxMTQ3NTkwZmU4OWNiYzY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commit/6edc07e86ca824d95f9e806a0c1f7e7fd47c757d","sha":"6edc07e86ca824d95f9e806a0c1f7e7fd47c757d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commits/6edc07e86ca824d95f9e806a0c1f7e7fd47c757d"}],"sha":"e692b08df32f1179afc92ae381147590fe89cbc6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commits/e692b08df32f1179afc92ae381147590fe89cbc6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commits/6edc07e86ca824d95f9e806a0c1f7e7fd47c757d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:30:05Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-21T07:30:05Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"refactor: nest GraphQL operations under a fullReadOnlyNotifier namespace container (#17)\n\nMove the weakly-prefixed root Query (fronotifierSettings) + root Mutation\n(updateFronotifierSettings) flat fields under one hierarchical namespace container named\nafter the module, per the Jahia GraphQL convention.\n\n- Query:    fronotifierSettings       -> fullReadOnlyNotifier { settings }\n- Mutation: updateFronotifierSettings -> fullReadOnlyNotifier { updateSettings }\n\nNew holder types FullReadOnlyNotifierQuery/Mutation carry the operations as instance\n@GraphQLField methods (Java method names kept; GqlFronotifierSettings/FronotifierConstants\nstay separate files); the *Extension classes keep a single fullReadOnlyNotifier accessor\nfield. @GraphQLRequiresPermission stays on each leaf. Frontend gql.js + jsx + jest test, and\nthe two unit tests + Cypress fixtures/specs updated in lockstep. Core JCR fixtures untouched.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"51b4f10edf631b693d56c79eb0fc94178e43602f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/git/trees/51b4f10edf631b693d56c79eb0fc94178e43602f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/git/commits/6edc07e86ca824d95f9e806a0c1f7e7fd47c757d","verification":{"payload":"tree 51b4f10edf631b693d56c79eb0fc94178e43602f\nparent f349cc557dc4be0b10ff4df301df2341acb70a8b\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1782027005 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1782027005 +0200\n\nrefactor: nest GraphQL operations under a fullReadOnlyNotifier namespace container (#17)\n\nMove the weakly-prefixed root Query (fronotifierSettings) + root Mutation\n(updateFronotifierSettings) flat fields under one hierarchical namespace container named\nafter the module, per the Jahia GraphQL convention.\n\n- Query:    fronotifierSettings       -> fullReadOnlyNotifier { settings }\n- Mutation: updateFronotifierSettings -> fullReadOnlyNotifier { updateSettings }\n\nNew holder types FullReadOnlyNotifierQuery/Mutation carry the operations as instance\n@GraphQLField methods (Java method names kept; GqlFronotifierSettings/FronotifierConstants\nstay separate files); the *Extension classes keep a single fullReadOnlyNotifier accessor\nfield. @GraphQLRequiresPermission stays on each leaf. Frontend gql.js + jsx + jest test, and\nthe two unit tests + Cypress fixtures/specs updated in lockstep. Core JCR fixtures untouched.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqN5L9CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHTkQAEEPNIBLmxxHrl2sOuxzvJm8\nwwf3j00cQZiDp3B2vC5ullyJEGkyNOLcKERvJsHRciQ8oLTR77+aVoHPgc9nw3Rc\nq2XFO01H4G786H69yEjqVsb3QxpDwjqzVM6s4deLjHLE2mpn7qZFQQ+qz72TUYZg\niqpGfvV0SyXefiLdzkQYLqmSzcDaYdYTSMC2Ac8T/vQRaf5JseaGqgogAkeTbQlR\ny5y3Nv8vSxmRlph+MW2U8PasQLc2OMU6IgZltMwWq12j58mxad/lu0t0z3O9S6Da\nxftX3XcccbKtt19qWN7k2UXzYCuNMbw9JlGjGnZREX1qfVZE61NE+ZwhiL+AGBeR\n1A2Qrys9vHJXz/sTryZPzVwA+s7JPauUPnJdIfkkU/FOSvh6pB42EzjIqpfLGj+u\ns3jfAWz9QpxL2NsTjYHIbYUjYAj3ARmwp01ykGeaweBlrM3A49sX/JLnVSVsc7DO\niJhANmZSnm3e8HTF8U6Xe62v9e9bh1PU85GX1Gl3xuXeaYz9p4mZdJLh3OdceRsw\n//yjeGHspVCGmye+xMTDjl5bWi6Ay0GJn7s4GZWdNbH+sS7dQfjbiOe6X1cyWuCi\na2tZbDgQ7mMBzM/PntayV8JDWvewL+oCJrJ1c3wzLQROzYuPNdN+YBnhjTb4OdMI\n7ElKeWl0EGNixPMKpO0x\n=xb1L\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-21T07:30:05Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commit/6edc07e86ca824d95f9e806a0c1f7e7fd47c757d","node_id":"C_kwDOCHvMzdoAKDZlZGMwN2U4NmNhODI0ZDk1ZjllODA2YTBjMWY3ZTdmZDQ3Yzc1N2Q","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commit/f349cc557dc4be0b10ff4df301df2341acb70a8b","sha":"f349cc557dc4be0b10ff4df301df2341acb70a8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commits/f349cc557dc4be0b10ff4df301df2341acb70a8b"}],"sha":"6edc07e86ca824d95f9e806a0c1f7e7fd47c757d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commits/6edc07e86ca824d95f9e806a0c1f7e7fd47c757d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commits/f349cc557dc4be0b10ff4df301df2341acb70a8b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-20T17:31:32Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSÉ"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-20T17:31:32Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Harden full-read-only-notifier: security, AAA accessibility, tests, i18n (#14)\n\n* fix: harden GraphQL backend — XSS sanitization, read-only query, PathNotFoundException, test coverage\n\nCRITICAL-1: FullReadOnlyNotifierQueryExtension.readSettings no longer calls\naddNode/session.save. If the fronotifier node is absent the query returns\nGqlFronotifierSettings(\"\",\"\") without touching the JCR. Node auto-creation\nremains exclusively in the mutation.\n\nCRITICAL-2 (SECURITY): FullReadOnlyNotifierMutationExtension.sanitizeContent\nnow validates UTF-8 byte length (<= 64 KiB) and runs Jsoup.clean() with\nSafelist.relaxed() + {class, style, target, rel} before writing contentOff/\ncontentOn to JCR. Strips <script>, on* handlers, and javascript: hrefs.\njsoup 1.18.1 added as provided-scope dependency (Jahia ships jsoup at runtime).\n\nHIGH-3: Both query and mutation catch PathNotFoundException from\nsession.getNode(); the query returns defaults, the mutation throws\nIllegalStateException with the safe siteKey only (no raw JCR path leaked).\nBoth log at WARN.\n\nMEDIUM: FronotifierConstants.SITE_KEY_PATTERN gains explicit ^ and $ anchors.\nCONTENT_MAX_LENGTH constant (65536) added.\nPROP_CONTENT_OFF/ON clarifying Javadoc added to resolve the naming ambiguity.\n\nTESTS: Added FullReadOnlyNotifierQueryExtensionTest (JUnit 4 + Mockito):\nnode-present read, node-absent returns defaults without save(), site missing\nreturns defaults. Added FullReadOnlyNotifierMutationExtensionTest: valid update\n(node exists / node absent), PathNotFoundException handling, invalid siteKey,\nlength-limit rejection, XSS tag stripping (script, javascript: href, onclick).\nmockito-core 4.11.0 added as test-scope dependency.\n\nPackage-private readSettings/writeSettings/sanitizeContent seams introduced to\nenable testing without a running OSGi container (JCRTemplate.getInstance() is\nstatic and cannot be mocked). A TODO comment documents the deferred OSGi\n@Reference injection refactor.\n\nREADME.md: architecture and sanitization deferral notes added.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n* fix: harden full-read-only-notifier (security, a11y AAA, i18n, tests)\n\nBackend (FullReadOnlyNotifier{Query,Mutation}Extension):\n- query is now side-effect-free (no addNode/save on read; returns defaults)\n- mutation sanitizes admin HTML server-side via embedded jsoup Safelist + 64KB cap\n- PathNotFoundException handled without leaking JCR paths; anchored siteKey regex\n- jsoup embedded in the bundle (Jahia does not export org.jsoup) so the GraphQL\n  extension class loads and the mutation/query register\n- 25 JUnit tests (mutation/query seams via Mockito)\n\nJSP banner: role=status + aria-live, accessible close button (i18n), AAA contrast\n(10.8:1), Escape-to-dismiss, focus management, 44px target, reflow, lang; fixed\nsetCookie expiry bug; hardened client froSanitize (defense-in-depth).\n\nAdmin UI: CKEditor label association + distinct toolbars + locale-following\nlanguage, reliable live region, aria-errormessage, focus mgmt, siteKey guard;\nfr.json locale; jest setup. Added .eslintrc/.eslintignore; internal-slot resolution.\n\nSonarQube gate OK; lint clean; settings Cypress spec 7/7.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n* test: publish parent in popup spec before() so component reaches live page\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n* test: drive full read-only via maintenance.jsp; publish settings+component to live\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"48279b8fe7f162144340099879c395a8ead0535b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/git/trees/48279b8fe7f162144340099879c395a8ead0535b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/git/commits/f349cc557dc4be0b10ff4df301df2341acb70a8b","verification":{"payload":"tree 48279b8fe7f162144340099879c395a8ead0535b\nparent b4518e3a9ded877406629b28f32221b0690d368a\nauthor Florent BOURASSÉ <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781976692 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1781976692 +0200\n\nHarden full-read-only-notifier: security, AAA accessibility, tests, i18n (#14)\n\n* fix: harden GraphQL backend — XSS sanitization, read-only query, PathNotFoundException, test coverage\n\nCRITICAL-1: FullReadOnlyNotifierQueryExtension.readSettings no longer calls\naddNode/session.save. If the fronotifier node is absent the query returns\nGqlFronotifierSettings(\"\",\"\") without touching the JCR. Node auto-creation\nremains exclusively in the mutation.\n\nCRITICAL-2 (SECURITY): FullReadOnlyNotifierMutationExtension.sanitizeContent\nnow validates UTF-8 byte length (<= 64 KiB) and runs Jsoup.clean() with\nSafelist.relaxed() + {class, style, target, rel} before writing contentOff/\ncontentOn to JCR. Strips <script>, on* handlers, and javascript: hrefs.\njsoup 1.18.1 added as provided-scope dependency (Jahia ships jsoup at runtime).\n\nHIGH-3: Both query and mutation catch PathNotFoundException from\nsession.getNode(); the query returns defaults, the mutation throws\nIllegalStateException with the safe siteKey only (no raw JCR path leaked).\nBoth log at WARN.\n\nMEDIUM: FronotifierConstants.SITE_KEY_PATTERN gains explicit ^ and $ anchors.\nCONTENT_MAX_LENGTH constant (65536) added.\nPROP_CONTENT_OFF/ON clarifying Javadoc added to resolve the naming ambiguity.\n\nTESTS: Added FullReadOnlyNotifierQueryExtensionTest (JUnit 4 + Mockito):\nnode-present read, node-absent returns defaults without save(), site missing\nreturns defaults. Added FullReadOnlyNotifierMutationExtensionTest: valid update\n(node exists / node absent), PathNotFoundException handling, invalid siteKey,\nlength-limit rejection, XSS tag stripping (script, javascript: href, onclick).\nmockito-core 4.11.0 added as test-scope dependency.\n\nPackage-private readSettings/writeSettings/sanitizeContent seams introduced to\nenable testing without a running OSGi container (JCRTemplate.getInstance() is\nstatic and cannot be mocked). A TODO comment documents the deferred OSGi\n@Reference injection refactor.\n\nREADME.md: architecture and sanitization deferral notes added.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n* fix: harden full-read-only-notifier (security, a11y AAA, i18n, tests)\n\nBackend (FullReadOnlyNotifier{Query,Mutation}Extension):\n- query is now side-effect-free (no addNode/save on read; returns defaults)\n- mutation sanitizes admin HTML server-side via embedded jsoup Safelist + 64KB cap\n- PathNotFoundException handled without leaking JCR paths; anchored siteKey regex\n- jsoup embedded in the bundle (Jahia does not export org.jsoup) so the GraphQL\n  extension class loads and the mutation/query register\n- 25 JUnit tests (mutation/query seams via Mockito)\n\nJSP banner: role=status + aria-live, accessible close button (i18n), AAA contrast\n(10.8:1), Escape-to-dismiss, focus management, 44px target, reflow, lang; fixed\nsetCookie expiry bug; hardened client froSanitize (defense-in-depth).\n\nAdmin UI: CKEditor label association + distinct toolbars + locale-following\nlanguage, reliable live region, aria-errormessage, focus mgmt, siteKey guard;\nfr.json locale; jest setup. Added .eslintrc/.eslintignore; internal-slot resolution.\n\nSonarQube gate OK; lint clean; settings Cypress spec 7/7.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n* test: publish parent in popup spec before() so component reaches live page\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n* test: drive full read-only via maintenance.jsp; publish settings+component to live\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n\n---------\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqNs50CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAvZcQAHDdlWtm4CXg0Ees9+RKIpqM\noNeBKc73B46b5NZV4lJilbXY8X5t442vUa+VfYbK8ZIDvD0CRUw/fCwMeGEPFmGD\nVoPVew6E6J62/vbJ11bMQVzZZGZd0gVaM0tAy4z7H+/J4d8pIDQag9r2mMF1+AWy\nrlesxCBwxn6xrDkBd9wIsRZOSIfnNlN7rtrvHENMjgBzZU2ffJuDVw/mqbtEyJMe\nbzzEJvS+PRzeD55A1VVpQ7WZMxA4eqWyzFM2KydT+rpbeLytc3t9Qk1r9zxIGilx\nnAK/Ha4bcs4BewymLlxLe37JUlSokOnJuyb6pufIpLx8h8lbCxR3N1c5DdDnaul7\nEeVoxhyvNH81EHdtXpWuXEwJmJFXHAF0cSXYDBJdvtHBeadnJDv60I5cmS/zy8Ob\nQqh+qs+2OzpDJ/thgnIFda2QB1ftkwGbJajC4RonQfL5iQ/Lsnl+wd6AaF0htmAj\n8EyYgQHMSTezz6i3XKY6DfRCiItTFlOB6IBVmsUpFXaUpOQXpaVzhU+eq65YBZRX\nQFEbQ5RkZMr3IwJ4U/HsXrHhz/biArlKTPl8YErhxGh/627d20R9bczzmKdgN2mk\nQx9zEemZafB3VHMXuRjXCGXRwInyAIg15ket1ZpMT3rsZki6oOSgU6Nz0oVdutxX\nYlMkynefq0W39Z3iNNm1\n=0TmN\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-20T17:31:32Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followin