ash, underscore, max length)\nand rejects null, empty, ''../'' traversal, forward slash, JCR meta chars,\nwhitespace, newline injection, and over-length input.\n\nNo behavioral changes to the GraphQL query/mutation logic. Module is a\nJCR settings store (no email), so email/CR-LF header concerns do not\napply; the security-critical surface is siteKey path construction, now\ncovered by tests. Tests run: 11, Failures: 0 (JUnit4 surefire provider).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"3636b2717a7d58f4f7f47488300c73907726620e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/git/trees/3636b2717a7d58f4f7f47488300c73907726620e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/git/commits/cee6be6506b1d10f79cb007de4bd30b285d80f77","verification":{"payload":"tree 3636b2717a7d58f4f7f47488300c73907726620e\nparent d22953f9dda01c7d941ad64fc3ff7076265b5e5e\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781071365 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1781071365 +0200\n\ntest: add unit tests for siteKey validation security boundary\n\nS1: extract magic number 150 into SITE_KEY_MAX_LENGTH constant in\nFronotifierConstants (behavior-preserving; documents the bound and\nits anti-DoS rationale).\n\nR1: add JUnit 4 test dependency and FronotifierConstantsTest (11 cases)\ncovering requireValidSiteKey() — the JCR path-traversal / injection\nguard: accepts valid keys (alphanumeric, dash, underscore, max length)\nand rejects null, empty, ''../'' traversal, forward slash, JCR meta chars,\nwhitespace, newline injection, and over-length input.\n\nNo behavioral changes to the GraphQL query/mutation logic. Module is a\nJCR settings store (no email), so email/CR-LF header concerns do not\napply; the security-critical surface is siteKey path construction, now\ncovered by tests. Tests run: 11, Failures: 0 (JUnit4 surefire provider).\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","