url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commits/958acfe4cc637bdeaac1b1b33c2b3a79652c2015/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-07T13:10:22Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-07T13:10:22Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"fix: consume richtext-ckeditor5 remote as richtextCkeditor5\n\nThe richtext-ckeditor5 module renamed its Module Federation container\nglobal from appShell.remotes.ckeditor5 to appShell.remotes.richtextCkeditor5\n(beta-3+ / 1.0.1). This module''s stale ''ckeditor5'' mapping only worked\nbecause its test manifest pinned richtext-ckeditor5/1.0.0-beta-2, masking\na latent break against current richtext-ckeditor5. Align the remote name\nand unpin the test manifest to LATEST.\n\nValidated: admin-UI E2E green against richtext-ckeditor5 LATEST (18/18).\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"c9ab624f8ebc11c599bea9bbf761914bf75fa284","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/git/trees/c9ab624f8ebc11c599bea9bbf761914bf75fa284"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/git/commits/958acfe4cc637bdeaac1b1b33c2b3a79652c2015","verification":{"payload":"tree c9ab624f8ebc11c599bea9bbf761914bf75fa284\nparent e51992b3cb88c22f7e10ea42624802bb490b6e24\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780837822 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1780837822 +0200\n\nfix: consume richtext-ckeditor5 remote as richtextCkeditor5\n\nThe richtext-ckeditor5 module renamed its Module Federation container\nglobal from appShell.remotes.ckeditor5 to appShell.remotes.richtextCkeditor5\n(beta-3+ / 1.0.1). This module''s stale ''ckeditor5'' mapping only worked\nbecause its test manifest pinned richtext-ckeditor5/1.0.0-beta-2, masking\na latent break against current richtext-ckeditor5. Align the remote name\nand unpin the test manifest to LATEST.\n\nValidated: admin-UI E2E green against richtext-ckeditor5 LATEST (18/18).\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmolbb4ACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3km1Qf+OxW6fHxDVdqHmR/t+QoyKLblZt2Yy88t98kD9Sh9yZQoWGkV91DM2cPr\n6OSOj6mRe8wVUvJsScXPm1/ixY1ZOlTi1ujlC0awWviEhTUE+PpoScdkMyyz6tNz\n3yj/f3hoX3vPY39ka2ZRDM0X59hSOmHVTF9ZbXV48XyYUf13ULVVjitL1u/SahSk\n6Mn35GuhPet+kCYCaThJJ/CKVYmAxZrzTVNe0MIDUcoFyDd05W1Ee/jMY/b8Gj0y\naNyV/w5eY47/uSPSyfx/E8WUrdR80mJA6lT0M4uvS3caL4dhuWSDXUrQBLtadzs8\nRl2FxFDc6863r2TtzaXubc5hDca2xA==\n=xq/D\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-07T13:37:36Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commit/958acfe4cc637bdeaac1b1b33c2b3a79652c2015","node_id":"C_kwDOCHvMzdoAKDk1OGFjZmU0Y2M2MzdiZGVhYWMxYjFiMzNjMmIzYTc5NjUyYzIwMTU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commit/e51992b3cb88c22f7e10ea42624802bb490b6e24","sha":"e51992b3c