n":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoJXd8ACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3mhygf+PO9BksLtNfw1WTyp2h3cuLoxeI4Scpxiky5KN3zrVfjZwYjrEjKWFQlB\nYOyW4OBf2FTSY5j8Swd3I8hgzzYpuShMcEZSpi3cH+2bMr06o+bustNoS/IGXyst\nWOnaxr11YxtAG6ZkXPdUUTsRJfBO8CvQzmL2xlg+OqsaLgDy7irXMXQ23Hkt8ZMq\ns0TiVLxSHXP8uyKhefnk195d8SiS21KUl9+cdVyHufKeLkwwXdm8nJu2njeHMUjG\n/qOlewcoxzJdu5yHxbgHl6vRg/4Yeg4b7/Wx4mK+BMCV2yvJD22piaE0uOp3WAD/\ncp4gk97i6IXY3AYgV2mcdIsPGANY0g==\n=lciE\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-05-19T09:49:18Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commit/1371cb72b4c5e28a5b7221aaa1f80d8c90169ba7","node_id":"C_kwDOCHvMzdoAKDEzNzFjYjcyYjRjNWUyOGE1YjcyMjFhYWExZjgwZDhjOTAxNjliYTc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commit/b63c0a9ed9f33000361552b77f4c31dd052ff474","sha":"b63c0a9ed9f33000361552b77f4c31dd052ff474","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commits/b63c0a9ed9f33000361552b77f4c31dd052ff474"}],"sha":"1371cb72b4c5e28a5b7221aaa1f80d8c90169ba7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commits/1371cb72b4c5e28a5b7221aaa1f80d8c90169ba7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/16238554?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/fbourasse","id":16238554,"login":"fbourasse","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE2MjM4NTU0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/fbourasse","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/commits/b63c0a9ed9f33000361552b77f4c31dd052ff474/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-05-16T08:01:21Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-05-16T08:01:21Z","email":"fbourasse@jahia.com","name":"Florent BOURASSE"},"message":"security: validate siteKey to prevent JCR path traversal\n\nThe fronotifierSettings query and updateFronotifierSettings mutation\nconcatenated the user-supplied siteKey directly into the JCR path\n/sites/{siteKey}. Because both operations run under a system session\n(doExecuteWithSystemSessionAsUser), a caller holding siteAdminUsers on\nany site could craft a siteKey containing path segments to traverse\noutside the intended /sites/<site> subtree or inject JCR-meta\ncharacters.\n\nAdd a FronotifierConstants helper that validates the siteKey against a\nstrict allow-list ([A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,150}) and centralizes the shared\nstring literals. Both extensions now fail closed with\nIllegalArgumentException on any invalid input before opening the\nprivileged session.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>","tree":{"sha":"d08a0ceee9863228c608b9de1bf2296363637af5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/git/trees/d08a0ceee9863228c608b9de1bf2296363637af5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Jahia/full-read-only-notifier/git/commits/b63c0a9ed9f33000361552b77f4c31dd052ff474","verification":{"payload":"tree d08a0ceee9863228c608b9de1bf2296363637af5\nparent f5d368d9e392c2f5fce757daf5afee312074e614\nauthor Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778918481 +0200\ncommitter Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com> 1778918481 +0200\n\nsecurity: validate siteKey to prevent JCR path traversal\n\nThe fronotifierSettings query and updateFronotifierSettings mutation\nconcatenated the user-supplied siteKey directly into the JCR path\n/sites/{siteKey}. Because both operations run under a system session\n(doExecuteWithSystemSessionAsUser), a caller holding siteAdminUsers on\nany site could craft a siteKey containing path segments to traverse\noutside the intended /sites/<site> subtree or inject JCR-meta\ncharacters.\n\nAdd a FronotifierConstants helper that validates the siteKey against a\nstrict allow-list ([A-Za-z0-9_-]{1,150}) and centralizes the shared\nstring literals. Both extensions now fail closed with\nIllegalArgumentException on any invalid input before opening the\nprivileged session.\n\nSigned-off-by: Florent BOURASSE <fbourasse@jahia.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niQEzBAABCgAdFiEEtcDrrZ6KblczSEt9UhsGUDwSL3kFAmoIJFEACgkQUhsGUDwS\nL3nEEAgAkQrb9xF0B/r2DybMPmXzGeX/L1TYDeiPGT4ifMAVrfPbVnDk906s2e1X\nABO1VQP4Evbn05o1z48CHsIPqXDVHUvbH2EmN8nHo4ruRe6qkkvK3uHLUo7acfaZ\nxK/Xt1y3xNj4gHbBxob69y6F