ia-controls on the Blog/Notes filter trigger\n  always references a real element\n- blog: fold reaction counts into the reaction button aria-label so screen\n  readers announce the same count sighted users see\n- header: drop eager/high-priority preload and the redundant alt text on\n  the 36px brand logo, which was competing with the true LCP element on\n  every page\n- not-found: recover trailing-slash URLs client-side, since GitHub Pages\n  has no server-side redirect and every authored route on this site is\n  slash-less (verified live: /en/blog/ and article paths with a trailing\n  slash were hard 404s)\n\nVerified: typecheck clean, lint clean (0 warnings), 27/27 affected tests\npass, production build succeeds, performance budgets pass.","tree":{"sha":"384525c0096bf4629e82521f320683ef0c57c9e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nguyenlephong/nguyenlephong.github.io/git/trees/384525c0096bf4629e82521f320683ef0c57c9e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nguyenlephong/nguyenlephong.github.io/git/commits/cafd703d7776cff8d43b2127bc524242c1282273","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/147224280?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phongnguyen-it/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phongnguyen-it/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phongnguyen-it/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phongnguyen-it/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/phongnguyen-it","id":147224280,"login":"phongnguyen-it","node_id":"U_kgDOCMZ22A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phongnguyen-it/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phongnguyen-it/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phongnguyen-it/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/phongnguyen-it/starred{/owner