"type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.openweathermap/commits/a24491cc24933b595d8e582aaf1e2bbab51db7e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T07:59:03Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T07:59:03Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Fixed widget build: declare the emotion dependencies\n\n@mui/material declares @emotion/react and @emotion/styled as optional peer\ndependencies, so npm does not install them automatically. They were only\npresent locally, and the widget build failed on a clean CI checkout with\n\"CacheProvider is not exported by __vite-optional-peer-dep:@emotion/react\".\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e0e4253d1d3313bee53dde5a55fdf67e338c6a1a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.openweathermap/git/trees/e0e4253d1d3313bee53dde5a55fdf67e338c6a1a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.openweathermap/git/commits/a24491cc24933b595d8e582aaf1e2bbab51db7e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.openweathermap/commit/a24491cc24933b595d8e582aaf1e2bbab51db7e6","node_id":"C_kwDOCIp7BtoAKGEyNDQ5MWNjMjQ5MzNiNTk1ZDhlNTgyYWFmMWUyYmJhYjUxZGI3ZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ioBroker/ioBroker.openweathermap/commit/529889c672677b62a99c797e43bc442f16b05b70","sha":"529889c672677b62a99c797e43bc442f16b05b70","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.openweathermap/commits/529889c672677b62a99c797e43bc442f16b05b70"}],"sha":"a24491cc24933b595d8e582aaf1e2bbab51db7e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.openweathermap/commits/a24491cc24933b595d8e582aaf1e2bbab51db7e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.openweathermap/commits/529889c672677b62a99c797e43bc442f16b05b70/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-16T07:52:30Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-16T07:52:30Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Fixed CI: disable npm cache and pin the install command\n\nThe ioBroker/testing-action-* actions default to package-cache: npm, which\nmakes actions/setup-node abort with \"Dependencies lock file is not found\".\nThis repository does not commit package-lock.json, so every run since the\nmigration to those actions failed before installing anything.\n\n* set package-cache: ''false'' for check, adapter tests and deploy\n* deploy also needs install-command: ''npm run npm'', the default npm ci\n  requires a lock file as well\n* bumped ioBroker/testing-action-check to v2.0.1 (#717)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"12ce2a3b0445faa4e6fbf4c49e1e70ca43f05b4d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.openweathermap/git/trees/12ce2a3b0445faa4e6fbf4c49e1e70ca43f05b4d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.openweathermap/git/commits/529889c672677b62a99c797e43bc442f16b05b70","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://a