ate":"2026-08-16T07:49:20Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"GermanBluefox"},"message":"Applied all open bot PRs\n\nImplements the intent of the 16 open bot pull requests instead of merging\nthem, as three of them rewrite .github/dependabot.yml in conflicting ways\nand five target workflow steps that no longer exist since the switch to\nthe ioBroker/testing-action-* actions.\n\n* #698 js-controller dependency raised to >=6.0.11\n* #697 added CHANGELOG_OLD.md and linked it from the README\n* #695, #677, #610 merged into one dependabot.yml: cron schedule, npm\n  cooldown of 7 days and the ignore rule for @types/node major updates\n* #641 replaced dependabot-automerge.yml with automerge-dependabot.yml\n* #626, #624 removed deprecated common.title and common.main\n* #611, #596 bumped actions/checkout to v6 and github/codeql-action to v4\n* #589 added .commitinfo to .gitignore\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d1d494fe8c115876349f508f487fde75e5af47fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.openweathermap/git/trees/d1d494fe8c115876349f508f487fde75e5af47fc"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ioBroker/ioBroker.openweathermap/git/commits/b72abcf16960b0c59718ae0c666ca870ab947f06","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/u