.com/users/mcm1957/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/commits/e2a7590d005e1f447f9b44c26c05e210db009379/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:11:14Z","email":"mcm57@gmx.at","name":"Martin M."},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-23T09:11:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix DM missing refresh after device discovery and firmware update (#1625)\n\n- handleDiscoverDevices now returns refresh:true after successfully provisioning devices so the device list updates without a manual page reload (refers to #1484)\n- onStateChange now sends a GUI ''all'' command when a firmware state flips from true to false, removing the stale ''Update firmware'' action from the card (refers to #1484)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d112caebd64ceb1c7d1c21c84bbf7a406ab2483d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/git/trees/d112caebd64ceb1c7d1c21c84bbf7a406ab2483d"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/git/commits/e2a7590d005e1f447f9b44c26c05e210db009379","verification":{"payload":"tree d112caebd64ceb1c7d1c21c84bbf7a406ab2483d\nparent 7e27bc6389d48bad9a4ed902f315677a2e27c6e6\nauthor Martin M. <mcm57@gmx.at> 1790154674 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790154674 +0200\n\nFix DM missing refresh after device discovery and firmware update (#1625)\n\n- handleDiscoverDevices now returns refresh:true after successfully provisioning devices so the device list updates without a manual page reload (refers to #1484)\n- onStateChange now sends a GUI ''all'' command when a firmware state flips from true to false, removing the stale ''Update firmware'' action from the card (refers to #1484)\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"va