.com/users/mcm1957/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/commits/6abd08ab6aff7dcea9391729c6d36ce535cfea57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T11:52:52Z","email":"mcm57@gmx.at","name":"Martin M."},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T11:52:52Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Add support for Shelly Camera (shellycamera) (#1618)\n\n* Add support for Shelly Camera (shellycamera)\n\nAdds the Gen3 Shelly Camera device with its Camera, CameraZone, Streamer\nand Storage components. Each component''s states are placed on the object\nthe Shelly API specifies them under. Camera/Storage logic lives in a new\ncamera-helper.ts module. Includes device icon, registry entries,\ntranslations for all new state names and a README changelog entry.\n\nrefers to #1617\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add Camera0.rtspStreamUrl state to Shelly Camera\n\nExposes a clickable RTSP stream URL (text.url) composed from the device\naddress. The RTSP server is disabled by default and must be enabled in the\ncamera configuration.\n\nrefers to #1617\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c684d09c97029a19723e9655653d4e77cb3ae28f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/git/trees/c684d09c97029a19723e9655653d4e77cb3ae28f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/git/commits/6abd08ab6aff7dcea9391729c6d36ce535cfea57","verification":{"payload":"tree c684d09c97029a19723e9655653d4e77cb3ae28f\nparent f179b00d4a17783cb849d1d73720d74de3f95aba\nauthor Martin M. <mcm57@gmx.at> 1790077972 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790077972 +0200\n\nAdd support for Shelly Camera (shellycamera) (#1618)\n\n* Add support for Shelly Camera (shellycamera)\n\nAdds the Gen3 Shelly Camera device with its Camera, CameraZone, Streamer\nand Storage components. Each component''s states are placed on the object\nthe Shelly API specifies them under. Camera/Storage logic lives in a new\ncamera-helper.ts module. Includes device icon, registry entries,\ntranslations for all new state names and a README changelog entry.\n\nrefers to #1617\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Add Camera0.rtspStreamUrl state to Shelly Camera\n\nExposes a clickable RTSP stream URL (text.url) composed from the device\naddress. The RTSP server is disabled by default and must be enabled in the\ncamera configuration.\n\nrefers to #1617\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsmwUCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAADXUQAKOwqFBEIC4al1cbpd6f4Eum\nTxqwGlIGkYzz/jBmLApsDmvNM55U7K7ZuD2defyxc0Zq+aWuhHBkoAQtZo3HJvot\n9jS3bxFvYmZetBi0T3t9yoLlGC67qw28sHbKouPDzxtEovlUQH+CVGOT67/y300k\nJo3KcBox7EHmUocJJPjJsgIeFoa/zVOt4qOYvPJ2pSffTyhKWXN0vzRniUN0j0Ih\nYqB2sSXIC3RvIMj+o9Om6wFOI/xPhSWToYYkAU2hz+yYyZ52oKfAvCbgr+VAEwoq\nao46V/GxPuiraDUtwoP5Kv/R+2oRkdTS8rfDQGr/IOwSWcVydtWvN+XqgPk7CGsm\no2OFA4xrp0oTY/kXSol1vzPk9d4gaySw9sQmNJKNlPjw1wrKP0SoLDtdMGn652B1\nfgT3BaS4qCXwKnPRRo5KwFiFoTVIa+KzjubG0x0iEwmPTGZy0HLYqyoMF90qBG0X\ntOcZyQhq9IwQA43p4mHy7c6fSHQgRL3OUMyB+Dyf5kkcT+VWPt3hGjqNzFLnaE1E\naURaz1IMH9ze6w/Z4mDh/zLtWSPeSSMYJmMZU5gv2DsOxs6Hl4lwQ0LdWHV920jJ\nTiyEewfYoqyjxltnhU0ZDJzyywp2jJlVCUtv8gUgijkoj4MUwal6i+XQJxhKVELY\nCt18qHwDw2xWs8RVmBqz\n=02b7\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-22T11:52:53Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/p