"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NTc1Nzc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/commits/4538c6a8f37edd018203495be3515f24dc26e831/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-19T14:26:56Z","email":"mcm57@gmx.at","name":"Martin M."},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-19T14:26:56Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Apply inverted-switch hotfix to further Shelly devices (refers to #1318) (#1608)\n\n* Apply MQTT outdated switch status hotfix to Shelly 1PM Mini Gen3 (refers to #1318)\n\nReuse fixMqttOutdatedSwitchStatus() from gen2-hotfixes for the Shelly 1PM Mini\nGen3 (shelly1pmminig3), which is affected by the same firmware bug where the\nswitch output is reported inverted on the status topic after a change.\n\nAlso removes a duplicated changelog line for the shelly1lg3 fix.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Apply MQTT outdated switch status hotfix to Pro 2PM and Plug S Gen3 (refers to #1318)\n\nReuse fixMqttOutdatedSwitchStatus() from gen2-hotfixes for the Shelly Pro 2PM\n(shellypro2pm, both switches) and Shelly Plug S Gen3 (shellyplugsg3), which are\naffected by the same firmware bug where the switch output is reported inverted\non the status topic after a change.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38dad83dcdc7d393a0840f908e02c15ce1f4c3fe","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly