"gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mcm1957","id":28575778,"login":"mcm1957","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NTc1Nzc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/commit/5d63c538d1b6ec6c7eca93b51171052a9ec2eaea","node_id":"C_kwDOCMaeW9oAKDVkNjNjNTM4ZDFiNmVjNmM3ZWNhOTNiNTExNzEwNTJhOWVjMmVhZWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/commit/3e35208fe69ba139e42fd04a0e6034a6f9d77bf0","sha":"3e35208fe69ba139e42fd04a0e6034a6f9d77bf0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/commits/3e35208fe69ba139e42fd04a0e6034a6f9d77bf0"}],"sha":"5d63c538d1b6ec6c7eca93b51171052a9ec2eaea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/commits/5d63c538d1b6ec6c7eca93b51171052a9ec2eaea"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4582016?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/GermanBluefox","id":4582016,"login":"GermanBluefox","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ1ODIwMTY=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/GermanBluefox","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/commits/3e35208fe69ba139e42fd04a0e6034a6f9d77bf0/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-18T17:08:47Z","email":"dogafox@gmail.com","name":"Bluefox"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-18T17:08:47Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix MQTT commands lost with \"mqtt prefix was not set\" during (re)connect (#1607)\n\n* Fix MQTT commands lost with \"mqtt prefix was not set\" during (re)connect\n\nCommands sent while a device was still initializing its MQTT connection\nwere dropped, because the mqtt prefix was only determined after the\nobjects were created and the HTTP states were polled.\n\n- Set the mqtt prefix from the last will right at connect, before the\n  objects (and with them the command handlers) are created\n- Queue commands which still need the prefix during initialization and\n  send them once the initialization is done\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Added a new \"Bluetooth map\"\n\n* Protection against 429\n\n* Updatet packages\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Martin M. <mcm57@gmx.at>","tree":{"sha":"cef55807091d74149adbaa5d20846cf347fcd44a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/git/trees/cef55807091d74149adbaa5d20846cf347fcd44a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/git/commits/3e35208fe69ba139e42fd04a0e6034a6f9d77bf0","verification":{"payload":"tree cef55807091d74149adbaa5d20846cf347fcd44a\nparent 5595c779a2868ffdd95f4c15621d6c212e6a31f6\nauthor Bluefox <dogafox@gmail.com> 1789751327 +0300\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789751327 +0200\n\nFix MQTT commands lost with \"mqtt prefix was not set\" during (re)connect (#1607)\n\n* Fix MQTT commands lost with \"mqtt prefix was not set\" during (re)connect\n\nCommands sent while a device was still initializing its MQTT connection\nwere dropped, because the mqtt prefix was only determined after the\nobjects were created and the HTTP states were polled.\n\n- Set the mqtt prefix from the last will right at connect, before the\n  objects (and with them the command handlers) are created\n- Queue commands which still need the prefix during initialization and\n  send them once the initialization is done\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Added a new \"Bluetooth map\"\n\n* Protection against 429\n\n* Updatet packages\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Martin M. <mcm57@gmx.at>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqrXAfCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWckQABlhp38jByiP8PDlE+ViMsYN\nPqsGd4CJAbvV7DxfDtYZ6PrNvs89fPe/amSSoY+l/95NAVxR7qh0ZlYN0FurOfjP\nPLut1IdrnHxlT1QyPxw7Pu/W7D/eXI8Mt24J7GbPFxqNOqIu7HJib+MjGjqTpDC1\ny54qAzgZirJfwsMYYoOeLAcF0dT4XkqEUTfRppi4fUyNx28gzBO0rgj7YH4IAZFu\ncsRY6eQ9Y0xQPxxrd3x5w1FDX4+BW9CXF536Su0WFfOl95f58w0DZiIMsqfDEDwe\niEfT97I2DurNG4MD38EABdMCpLCpZDNywJirGfDsOq+a9POZ8/kVSwOr5AIJGK9l\n+/eK0Qc/KfyUtGOepAv4yya81kPeNlL9gvlSnHIBj42Z0WjX7k2a4dKpQLhbjp32\ngwWqqUvoCviWxY/EDtlYKdNRb2h0zB/9vYNt1ZzI+4YOtC5IbnrfQSfMl8AgN5+B\nTMAkMEkjQDFEny0kGE3khLe8ybVKNAEfIiuWqKEG3XcotDzzC2HlBNVDUAABJ4M5\noYLto5mZLAwg/9VbhMNh6ySQXZzHxFc0uJNhcHZsCj0Ys1h2J4XoJyG4HsjddX9u\ntg9l9zDDjsfSxZqqo8sr1UHPCJyPiqJ9El+GbPWLLR3f4CzTNARXgRuxekU3625D\nbLWsZxiMdOCrHiTreb+g\n=5EYQ\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-18T17:08:48Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.g