Shelly 3EM total state names\n\nRenaming the Total channel states introduced two new object names\n(\"Instantaneous power\", \"Returned\") that had no key in src/i18n/*.json,\nwhich failed the translation test. Added both keys with translations\nin all 11 languages (refers to SHEM-3 device manager labels).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a2eaa792e7183192c227ec0a55ebf22d6ba610c0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/git/trees/a2eaa792e7183192c227ec0a55ebf22d6ba610c0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/git/commits/9495015c1e05f9a4a4d7ec7839c2c4c6e9763508","verification":{"payload":"tree a2eaa792e7183192c227ec0a55ebf22d6ba610c0\nparent ed042822f294160039696d394eb0ce30da2073d0\nauthor Martin M. <mcm57@gmx.at> 1789646166 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789646166 +0200\n\nfeat: add support for Shelly 1L Gen4 and Shelly 2L Gen4 (#1602)\n\n* feat: add support for Shelly 1L Gen4 and Shelly 2L Gen4 (refers to #1384)\n\nAdd device definitions for shelly1lg4 and shelly2lg4, modelled on the\nexisting Gen3 1L/2L devices, and register them in all datapoints tables.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix: add i18n keys for renamed Shelly 3EM total state names\n\nRenaming the Total channel states introduced two new object names\n(\"Instantaneous power\", \"Returned\") that had no key in src/i18n/*.json,\nwhich failed the translation test. Added both keys with translations\nin all 11 languages (refers to SHEM-3 device manager labels).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqq9VWCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAkzcQADqOohoh2FpTqy3bNYx9eOT7\n3okOinQhg8yw/s9RxVwJJ9fnXxldEWGwUwLEWe0VX2djAA7Elbn