","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/commit/a94c31124b5a06f1fb07d6a6e4ac4f4e51f97273","node_id":"C_kwDOCMaeW9oAKGE5NGMzMTEyNGI1YTA2ZjFmYjA3ZDZhNmU0YWM0ZjRlNTFmOTcyNzM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/commit/989580faed26edc5326963f779af25ec11a4f500","sha":"989580faed26edc5326963f779af25ec11a4f500","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/commits/989580faed26edc5326963f779af25ec11a4f500"}],"sha":"a94c31124b5a06f1fb07d6a6e4ac4f4e51f97273","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/commits/a94c31124b5a06f1fb07d6a6e4ac4f4e51f97273"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28575778?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mcm1957","id":28575778,"login":"mcm1957","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NTc1Nzc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/commits/989580faed26edc5326963f779af25ec11a4f500/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T10:38:26Z","email":"mcm57@gmx.at","name":"Martin M."},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-17T10:38:26Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: drop redundant \"Total\" prefix in Shelly 3EM total state names (#1601)\n\nThe device manager composes energy labels as \"<channel> <state name>\".\nThe shellyem3 Total channel states embedded \"Total\" in their names,\nproducing duplicated labels like \"Total Total Instantaneous power\".\nRemoving the redundant word yields clean labels such as \"Total\nInstantaneous power\" (refers to device manager labels for SHEM-3).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"72f73b5e575010dba2eb3ef5cc36008c0cbe8b22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/git/trees/72f73b5e575010dba2eb3ef5cc36008c0cbe8b22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/git/commits/989580faed26edc5326963f779af25ec11a4f500","verification":{"payload":"tree 72f73b5e575010dba2eb3ef5cc36008c0cbe8b22\nparent 088c599259025110003c503935f9ef76561bada0\nauthor Martin M. <mcm57@gmx.at> 1789641506 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789641506 +0200\n\nfix: drop redundant \"Total\" prefix in Shelly 3EM total state names (#1601)\n\nThe device manager composes energy labels as \"<channel> <state name>\".\nThe shellyem3 Total channel states embedded \"Total\" in their names,\nproducing duplicated labels like \"Total Total Instantaneous power\".\nRemoving the redundant word yields clean labels such as \"Total\nInstantaneous power\" (refers to device manager labels for SHEM-3).\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqq8MiCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAS8MQAK8gsX49ZYcVyDfaY81Or4Re\n5tfBbL2VHMVndGKCKwH1Xfq1/jrjpHJhOhHG7vqjrRmX1E2gYu6fko5+p6SwXPbY\nU+88R+6vsG16y4Xktoq/cp