261"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/git/commits/088c599259025110003c503935f9ef76561bada0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28575778?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mcm1957","id":28575778,"login":"mcm1957","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NTc1Nzc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/commit/088c599259025110003c503935f9ef76561bada0","node_id":"C_kwDOCMaeW9oAKDA4OGM1OTkyNTkwMjUxMTAwMDNjNTAzOTM1ZjllZjc2NTYxYmFkYTA","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/commit/cda3d755a88966cd23c98c78856fde7527b6a990","sha":"cda3d755a88966cd23c98c78856fde7527b6a990","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/commits/cda3d755a88966cd23c98c78856fde7527b6a990"}],"sha":"088c599259025110003c503935f9ef76561bada0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/commits/088c599259025110003c503935f9ef76561bada0"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/28575778?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mcm1957","id":28575778,"login":"mcm1957","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI4NTc1Nzc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mcm1957","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/commits/cda3d755a88966cd23c98c78856fde7527b6a990/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-16T19:40:38Z","email":"mcm57@gmx.at","name":"Martin M."},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-16T19:40:38Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: robust Gen2+ digest auth nonce handling for firmware 2.x (refers to #1543) (#1588)\n\n* fix: robust Gen2+ digest auth nonce handling for firmware 2.x\n\nFirmware 2.x manages digest nonces per RFC 7616. Two problems broke authentication (\"Wrong http username or http password!\" despite correct credentials):\n\n- The www-authenticate parser split each field on every \"=\", truncating Base64 nonces that end in \"=\" padding. Parse on the first \"=\" only so the nonce is preserved.\n- An expired nonce is answered with \"401 stale=true\"; the client now retries once with the fresh nonce instead of reporting a credential error.\n\nrefers to #1543\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Improve parseDigestChallenge for better parsing\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Change parseDigestChallenge to private access modifier\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: use correct parameter name in parseDigestChallenge (refers to #1543)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* style: remove blank line to satisfy prettier (refers to #1543)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Refactor parseDigestChallenge to clean header input\n\nRemove ''Digest '' prefix from the header string.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"3f72756be947a4fb46b4dc547b6b5ca2e70de725","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/git/trees/3f72756be947a4fb46b4dc547b6b5ca2e70de725"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/git/commits/cda3d755a88966cd23c98c78856fde7527b6a990","verification":{"payload":"tree 3f72756be947a4fb46b4dc547b6b5ca2e70de725\nparent fd7ae72577e4f34c26f43fab0a5c527e00d6e72a\nauthor Martin M. <mcm57@gmx.at> 1789587638 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1789587638 +0200\n\nfix: robust Gen2+ digest auth nonce handling for firmware 2.x (refers to #1543) (#1588)\n\n* fix: robust Gen2+ digest auth nonce handling for firmware 2.x\n\nFirmware 2.x manages digest nonces per RFC 7616. Two problems broke authentication (\"Wrong http username or http password!\" despite correct credentials):\n\n- The www-authenticate parser split each field on every \"=\", truncating Base64 nonces that end in \"=\" padding. Parse on the first \"=\" only so the nonce is preserved.\n- An expired nonce is answered with \"401 stale=true\"; the client now retries once with the fresh nonce instead of reporting a credential error.\n\nrefers to #1543\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Improve parseDigestChallenge for better parsing\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* Change parseDigestChallenge to private access modifier\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n* fix: use correct parameter name in parseDigestChallenge (refers to #1543)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* style: remove blank line to satisfy prettier (refers to #1543)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* Refactor parseDigestChallenge to clean header input\n\nRemove ''Digest '' prefix from the header string.\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <175728472+Copilot@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqqvC2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAAPUQAIE/tB467ZoHxMhiyRvSzRrI\npf8X0u8GMEW/sKTHI5IqOni0uzIxooU5Wog9w+E5J3VbBOXlX93uX9KKuZnHCGVp\n5sKYCGu6bUgZBR5nKLqaZH+eP43MmRtlerXbM69JTjGbzzH/dexxZCHzLsbq6Zpb\nWIKYgN/RBq8kYGhQ/RXfW3XvZ+niIOM+Yvh7JX0qc5vEONtlC22DMIoCGPkPnilN\nbLJFkTKxg4UjzXkWexiAGZ5Ov294js1aKsWH4p8vB90iBkK7QcMtkCrd/ccmWhxM\nV2yfJEXCig61+vjv/gcv3yHlXzbmMvn+/N6tSsb0nrXHf0oGfsNlgRKKFtsa/lMf\n7+aXmA6zD38UCyCZHcfVdp0wsEqDrw/M7UI79Wi0iq2hcH4LhG1A14YsDGuG8y7z\nrjV3U1pb3PaPR6O/WXDzn86ARuzygcIdLp2qzV+U5V1VWyGZzpSlTYujxFCgWjs9\nKucq9el7FdCCNEzL7QszURnaXXTRfiO1D65qw3FakEUHhXOKPMCHabafjR8PZO1h\ncZz3AQpjh6osrklEgwmNyexhyOTDXqExTrIY82NXHuH2jKljfNskTB3aNEzTH4HZ\nsMQEvk4R42x3IKHIZ1lT44NSr9g5b5JfKKmHUpIBArNSaXnKOvEBrG1SD2TCuWg/\nT+UiBS44c0eTRUuEUMcf\n=9h4w\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-16T19:40:38Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19