-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/commits/3ad35ba93d2b1eba3c4a4d1d21611b0c21792c6b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-09T17:29:14Z","email":"mcm57@gmx.at","name":"Martin M."},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-09T17:29:14Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat: add support for FrankEver Smart Sprinkler Controller (irrigation) (#1591)\n\n* feat: add support for FrankEver Smart Sprinkler Controller (irrigation)\n\nImplement the Shelly XT1 based FrankEver Smart Sprinkler Controller\n(product code S3XT-0S). The irrigation functionality is exposed via the\nXMOD service (owner \"service:0\") with typed virtual-component roles:\nper-zone enable switches (zone0..zone5), watering duration / started_at /\nsource from zones_status, average temperature, last precipitation and the\nactive irrigation sequence.\n\nrefers to #1207\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor: store StartedAt as raw epoch seconds\n\nAlign the irrigation zone StartedAt timestamp with the existing\ngen2-helper convention (role ''date'', raw epoch seconds) instead of\nconverting to epoch milliseconds.\n\nrefers to #1207\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"bc662aa4da5a5b85b0b6faa24fa1db54dd6fc526","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/git/trees/bc662aa4da5a5b85b0b6faa24fa1db54dd6fc526"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/iobroker-community-adapters/ioBroker.shelly/git/commits/3ad35ba93d2b1eba3c4a4d1d21611b0c21792c6b","verification":{"payload":"tree bc662aa4da5a5b85b0b6faa24fa1db54dd6fc526\nparent ce77fe5fd74de5a6423de7199302456add358ff9\nauthor Martin M. <mcm57@gmx.at> 1788974954 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1788974954 +0200\n\nfeat: add support for FrankEver Smart Sprinkler Controller (irrigation) (#1591)\n\n* feat: add support for FrankEver Smart Sprinkler Controller (irrigation)\n\nImplement the Shelly XT1 based FrankEver Smart Sprinkler Controller\n(product code S3XT-0S). The irrigation functionality is exposed via the\nXMOD service (owner \"service:0\") with typed virtual-component roles:\nper-zone enable switches (zone0..zone5), watering duration / started_at /\nsource from zones_status, average temperature, last precipitation and the\nactive irrigation sequence.\n\nrefers to #1207\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* refactor: store StartedAt as raw epoch seconds\n\nAlign the irrigation zone StartedAt timestamp with the existing\ngen2-helper convention (role ''date'', raw epoch seconds) instead of\nconverting to epoch milliseconds.\n\nrefers to #1207\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqoZdqCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAI9wQADJ2rzho01rGmlRjelhUnB5J\n8OyOkVQHoBD538KXjqDgx67jIhxa8IyiPiU1Z30WGugV9iv2+7j/4bGgzGEVMhvR\nCwgi/iSHnw6tAJN3lhA1Z+CW2EFjkGM2D0BjgcPuJg6TJ3yVa8ZWds6QDagKkSNP\n12URkeVDYsKbGpk/1dBR1MkUAFbjRS5ZFjFnW/7bjycg23bnzrWPNQ8Cd3Y1SJfJ\n4ccEsE6ev0bKtKFIrNwrpU0lFm0jxQtQGU/f+exjqnTNY0XPcqP3mnid7j8Y/W+1\nu2qhVBcLHNBjAltwAhFjVTQGnP0k8A3pjj2IH6mUCr8FZy4XvF0WASfk0CTXyjW6\nSN0m69uoPOqajzC7vlQQC42hRPZNYKywaUY8tegvWIKY5zR88ZJbsVgz4bS0NWhd\nkg8LvagEEtzcV+ScVoVIxCB/1M96JXYeLYqovNEDjUCto0Q1+lry1Sqasd+DcekD\nLpLdiX7gYJ0p7mReL/5nhymObEr5QbnWWf78rgGWCVoaj17ks46F25020T8x899+\ndhGZQoCTXsM6EalvXTDNr6D8naUmA6AyXB4hEfbaN38dyLSOm8+tKydt9UcIf7JS\nKlSPYWKS3QQJOMcdZsNxx8Oq+VHnMe9VI05RwZlgRIWid1yEkrxPTCHVatz71U04\nqaDC/+hNiUmDtJw2kfZh\n=lrnM\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-09T17:29:15Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","followi