Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/292da69a6ce23e8bdc8a13eaf4b7b07f0010d910/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:10:25Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T15:10:25Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"message":"#ENG-102537 Leave the CrtProcessBuilder archive to the package''s clio delivery\n\ncrt-process-builder now delivers its archive into clio by itself (ENG-92113,\ncrt-process-builder #83): a green main build whose PackageVersion is above\nthe one clio ships opens rebundle/crtprocessbuilder-<version> with the\narchive and the four pins, producing commit on main. Carrying 1.6.6.91 here\nas well would race that PR on the same two files, so this PR goes back to\nmaster''s archive and pins (1.6.6.88) and keeps the MCP texts and tests. The\n1.6.6.90/1.6.6.91-only e2e cases skip until the stand carries that package.\n\nMerge order: crt-process-builder #91 -> the bot''s rebundle PR for 1.6.6.91 ->\nclio-knowledge #266 -> this PR.\n\nValidated: dotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj -f net10.0 --filter \"TestCategory=Unit&(Module=McpServer|Module=Common)\" (8526 passed, 5 skipped)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"059dad20d1f74fd480cf0a5adec65873a2c3b39f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/059dad20d1f74fd480cf0a5adec65873a2c3b39f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/292da69a6ce23e8bdc8a13eaf4b7b07f0010d910","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"http