User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/422c99baeeb2f654817d57082dba0174f00bce2b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:37:08Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:37:08Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"message":"ENG-102333 Review: a restart by credentials whose request is unconfirmed has an unknown outcome\n\nrestart-status cannot see a credentials-started restart, so the notice for a\nrequest that had not returned at the deadline now says outright that the\noutcome is unknown, that an answering instance proves nothing (after a failed\nrequest it answers because it never went down), and to ask the user before\nrestarting again. By environment name the notice says requestfailed means no\nrestart happened: ask the user, then retry once.\n\nValidated:\ndotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj --filter \"FullyQualifiedName~RestartToolTests|FullyQualifiedName~RestartStatusToolTests\" (28 passed)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9efbc9449c01e9d7095e60bcf6e23a487da554f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/9efbc9449c01e9d7095e60bcf6e23a487da554f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/422c99baeeb2f654817d57082dba0174f00bce2b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":""