stov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/0253e648fe4b6f5567b9fb791a07e5158c387041/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:34:43Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:34:43Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"message":"ENG-102333 Review: restart wording after the request moved into the race\n\nSince the restart request runs inside the deadline race, an in-progress\nanswer can come before the request is confirmed. Both restart descriptions\nno longer say \"the restart itself already succeeded\"; they say the note\ntells which, and restart-by-environment-name names requestfailed (no\nrestart happened: ask the user, then retry once). The workspace template\nsays the same, the credentials path points at describe-environment instead\nof a healthcheck tool MCP does not have, and RestartOperationStatus.Running\ndescribes both phases.\n\nValidated:\ndotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory=Unit&Module=McpServer\" (6169 passed)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f860d77e1cb2b8b73f04e7a3866f799bf271711","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/0f860d77e1cb2b8b73f04e7a3866f799bf271711"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/0253e648fe4b6f5567b9fb791a07e5158c387041","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","follow