ers/d-krestov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/a4bcd1438350df06ad607ebdc09f61c0a5e54f98/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:22:03Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:22:03Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"message":"#ENG-102537 Final review: prompt test checks both refused tasks, current pin remarks\n\nGate-3 review follow-ups, tests only:\n- The modify prompt test now names UserQuestionUserTask as well and fails\n  if User dialog / Auto-generated page return to the \"types you can build\"\n  list.\n- Pin remarks: the producing branch is this one, earlier cuts no longer\n  call themselves \"this cut\", the third version digit is 1.6.6, and Delete\n  data is named as the element that already warned (ENG-92709).\n\nValidated: dotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj -f net10.0 --filter \"FullyQualifiedName~ModifyBusinessProcessToolTests|FullyQualifiedName~BundledProcessBuilderPackageTests\" (55/55)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"a58a3d7ab940f665a67bead887484f64b000fbe8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/a58a3d7ab940f665a67bead887484f64b000fbe8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/a4bcd1438350df06ad607ebdc09f61c0a5e54f98","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.githu