"organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/9164446629ea88ec420d8ac459be6da445d755e6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:17:50Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:17:50Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"message":"ENG-102333 Review: race the restart request, one rule summary with both exits, seven minutes\n\n- restart-by-environment-name / restart-by-credentials: the restart request\n  now runs inside the response-deadline race, not before it. The operation\n  is begun first, so an answer that arrives before the request returned\n  says the request is not yet confirmed and points at restart-status, which\n  reports a failed request as the new status requestfailed.\n- One short form of the history rule (CompileStatusTool.HistoryRuleSummary)\n  with both exits - the user''s confirmation before a restart on rows alone,\n  and a stop with the user when no row ever comes - is reused by the\n  compile-status and compile-creatio descriptions and the contract\n  anti-pattern; the template carries the same text.\n- Finished is now \"newest row over seven minutes old\": clio''s own\n  five-minute quiet window plus two minutes for a slower reload and for\n  skew between the clio host''s clock and the environment''s. The\n  finished-seconds-ago field says which clocks it compares.\n- New e2e: a restart whose login hangs answers in-progress at a 2 s\n  deadline, and restart-status already tracks the operation it names.\n\nValidated:\ndotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory=Unit&(Module=McpServer|Module=Command|Module=Common)\" (13943 passed)\ndotnet test clio.mcp.e2e -f net10.0 --filter RestartToolE2ETests|CompileCreatioClientTimeoutE2ETests|CompileCreatioToolE2ETests|ToolContractGet_Should_Advertise_PackageCompile_Fails_On_Compile_Error|ApplicationSectionToolE2ETests(NoEnvironment) (20/20)\ndotnet test clio.mcp.e2e --filter RestartRequestDeadlineE2ETests (net8.0 and net10.0)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4949f26f2cdd6c64d36cc964a6cbc4a9c2551010","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/4949f26f2cdd6c64d36cc964a6cbc4a9c2551010"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/9164446629ea88ec420d8ac459be6da445d755e6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-krestov","id":180284958,"login":"d-krestov","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7uHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commit/9164446629ea88ec420d8ac459be6da445d755e6","node_id":"C_kwDOCPepK9oAKDkxNjQ0NDY2MjllYTg4ZWM0MjBkOGFjNDU5YmU2ZGE0NDVkNzU1ZTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commit/8751cc9e118c3c6bb67edba59b7136e21f17a969","sha":"8751cc9e118c3c6bb67edba59b7136e21f17a969","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/8751cc9e118c3c6bb67edba59b7136e21f17a969"}],"sha":"9164446629ea88ec420d8ac459be6da445d755e6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/9164446629ea88ec420d8ac459be6da445d755e6"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-krestov","id":180284958,"login":"d-krestov","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7uHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/8751cc9e118c3c6bb67edba59b7136e21f17a969/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:02:03Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:02:03Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"message":"ENG-102333 Review: tool wording that still assumed the 150 s deadline\n\n- create-app-section: at the 45 s default most creations answer\n  in-progress, and that answer dropped next-step, the browser-tab\n  instruction only a completed answer carried. It depends only on the\n  environment, so the in-progress answer now carries it too. The\n  description no longer says \"await completion\", and says a failed\n  menu-cache clear can only be reported by a completed answer.\n- compile-creatio: the package-name sentence promised a verdict; a package\n  compile usually outlasts 45 s, so it now says the call answers\n  in-progress with exit-code 0, which is NOT a successful compile, and\n  that compile-status carries the exit code and diagnostics.\n- restart: a remark states that the request phase is outside the\n  deadline race, why, and what racing it would need.\n\nValidated:\ndotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory=Unit&(Module=McpServer|Module=Command)\" (11629 passed)\ndotnet test clio.mcp.e2e -f net10.0 --filter ApplicationSectionToolE2ETests (NoEnvironment) | CompileCreatioClientTimeoutE2ETests | ToolContractGet_Should_Advertise_PackageCompile_Fails_On_Compile_Error (8/8)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"530686849b7626146153ff5f5ed76261bb049376","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/530686849b7626146153ff5f5ed76261bb049376"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/8751cc9e118c3c6bb67edba59b7136e21f17a969","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krest