bscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/dkorotin1","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commit/e9b2fef77bf60c638633d02dfa0bb1aab5624805","node_id":"C_kwDOCPepK9oAKGU5YjJmZWY3N2JmNjBjNjM4NjMzZDAyZGZhMGJiMWFhYjU2MjQ4MDU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commit/99a2db02478bcde0a7192cd8c40bd39916505cac","sha":"99a2db02478bcde0a7192cd8c40bd39916505cac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/99a2db02478bcde0a7192cd8c40bd39916505cac"}],"sha":"e9b2fef77bf60c638633d02dfa0bb1aab5624805","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/e9b2fef77bf60c638633d02dfa0bb1aab5624805"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-krestov","id":180284958,"login":"d-krestov","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7uHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/09b1819f50e7f6556fb7c37e7c2d0ec36d634392/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:40:52Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:40:52Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"message":"ENG-102333 Final-gate review: unambiguous finished rule, restart needs the user, tighter project names\n\n- The not-found note''s \"no row is that recent\" now reads \"no row was written\n  since your call\": after the five-minute sentence it read as the opposite\n  of the finished rule. Every surface says \"only once\".\n- Five minutes is cited as what it is - the quiet window clio''s own compile\n  uses when it sees no reload - not as the 5 min 10 s measurement, which was\n  that window.\n- A restart that rests on history rows alone needs the user''s confirmation:\n  any schema publisher can write a row.\n- An unresolvable environment-name no longer offers last-compilation-log,\n  which resolves the same name; an unreadable history says to stop after a\n  poll or two.\n- project-name passes unfenced only as dot-separated identifiers ending in\n  .csproj, up to 64 characters; a regex timeout reads as \"no match\".\n- Docs, ADR annotations and both knowledge records corrected.\n\nValidated:\ndotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory=Unit&(Module=McpServer|Module=Common)\" (8495 passed)\ndotnet test clio.mcp.e2e --filter CompileCreatioClientTimeoutE2ETests|CompileStatus_Should_ReturnNotFound_ForNeverCompiledEnvironment (5/5, net8.0 and net10.0)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e1b5f1cf45b329e12bda3b178457e19b0fcae86b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/e1b5f1cf45b329e12bda3b178457e19b0fcae86b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/09b1819f50e7f6556fb7c37e7c2d0ec36d634392","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/p