io","node_id":"U_kgDOEv3i_g","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antonChernovCreatio/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antonChernovCreatio/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antonChernovCreatio/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antonChernovCreatio/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/antonChernovCreatio/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/antonChernovCreatio","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/c3df8a6c1999487cb8d13e73a29c22c22f15ecb3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:24:50Z","email":"anton.chernov@creatio.com","name":"Anton Chernov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:24:50Z","email":"anton.chernov@creatio.com","name":"Anton Chernov"},"message":"ENG-99970 Send a failed target resolution to the user, not to list-packages\n\nThe resolver''s no-target errors ended with \"see list-packages for the\navailable names\", which leads an agent straight back to guessing a write\ntarget from a list that cannot say which packages accept changes - the\npattern this PR removes. They now end with one AskForPackage sentence,\npinned on the unset and dangling CurrentPackageId paths. A named package\nthat does not exist keeps its list-packages pointer: there the user''s\nspelling is what is wrong.\n\nAlso drops two ToolContractShortForm comments the packageName sentence\nmade stale (the warning''s position and character offset).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1b6ed3d320059a300ee40ff63d1bb54bf82e0f37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/1b6ed3d320059a300ee40ff63d1bb54bf82e0f37"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/c3df8a6c1999487cb8d13e73a29c22c22f15ecb3","verification":{