tps://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-krestov","id":180284958,"login":"d-krestov","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7uHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/922fcce7b3e4ed623a4e5c8f8b33daca1c2130d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:59:02Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:59:02Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"message":"#ENG-102537 Code review: clearer refusal and prompt wording, current pin remarks\n\n- list-user-tasks: ''instead and tell the user, or have the task added in the process designer''.\n- modify prompt: the result-enumerating list is one sentence again; designer-built User dialog\n  and Auto-generated page get their own.\n- BundledProcessBuilderPackageTests: ''What THIS cut carries'' describes 1.6.6.90 (ENG-102537)\n  instead of the 1.6.5.x multi-instance cut.\n\nReview skipped for this commit: text and comment changes taken from the code review just run.\nValidated: dotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory=Unit&(Module=Common|Module=McpServer)\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e02d558bfb03c2018c63b84c40336f47bcd9932e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/e02d558bfb03c2018c63b84c40336f47bcd9932e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/922fcce7b3e4ed623a4e5c8f8b33daca1c2130d2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-krestov","id":180284958,"login":"d-krestov","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7uHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commit/922fcce7b3e4ed623a4e5c8f8b33daca1c2130d2","node_id":"C_kwDOCPepK9oAKDkyMmZjY2U3YjNlNGVkNjIzYTRlNWM4ZjhiMzNkYWNhMWMyMTMwZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commit/3ae61518d5724b9bef8ca567dba296d371b67f7c","sha":"3ae61518d5724b9bef8ca567dba296d371b67f7c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/3ae61518d5724b9bef8ca567dba296d371b67f7c"}],"sha":"922fcce7b3e4ed623a4e5c8f8b33daca1c2130d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/922fcce7b3e4ed623a4e5c8f8b33daca1c2130d2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-krestov","id":180284958,"login":"d-krestov","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7uHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/8d9b6c9ee45a3ae0a6f5902e880e49caf3d68648/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:57:38Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T11:57:38Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"message":"ENG-102333 Answer before a 60 s client gives up, and read the compilation history on not-found\n\nQA on Claude Code desktop 2.1.293: the client gives up on a tool call after\n60 s and, on its next call, restarts the clio MCP server. The restart ends\nevery worker, so compile-status answered not-found although the compile\nran, and one agent''s timeout killed the other agents'' calls.\n\nDeadline (option 1):\n- McpProgressHeartbeat.DefaultResponseDeadline 150 s -> 45 s, so\n  compile-creatio, restart-*, create-app-section and the bundled installs\n  answer \"in progress\" before 60 s. Measured on a stand: a full compile\n  answered at 46.2 s and compile-status then reported it to the end.\n- The restart tools count the deadline from before their restart request.\n- run-process keeps its own 150 s: its per-call worker is killed after the\n  answer, so an earlier \"launched, do not re-run\" could precede the launch.\n\nCompilation history (option 3):\n- compile-status not-found reads the environment''s CompilationHistory\n  through DataService and converts the session-zone times to UTC with the\n  session''s own offset (GetApplicationInfo userTimezoneOffset). OData was\n  rejected: it labels the entity layer''s value as UTC, which one stand\n  returned as local time with a Z after a restart.\n- The answer lists the newest 10 rows (finished-utc, finished-seconds-ago,\n  succeeded, fenced errors), older-failures among the newest 100, and a\n  distinct error for an environment-name that does not resolve. The read\n  is bounded at 25 s, login included.\n- Agents are told a compile has finished only when its newest row is over\n  five minutes old (measured: 5 min 10 s from the last row to the end of a\n  full compile), and to ask the user before compiling again.\n- An unknown operation-id is named in the note.\n\nThe e2e harness pins the deadline to 150 s for stand tests that assert\nfinal results; new e2e tests cover the default and the history read.\n\nValidated:\ndotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory=Unit\" (15889 passed)\ndotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory=Unit&Module=McpServer\" (6169 passed, after the last edit)\ndotnet test clio.mcp.e2e --filter CompileCreatioClientTimeoutE2ETests|CompileStatus_Should_ReturnNotFound_ForNeverCompiledEnvironment (5/5, net8.0 and net10.0)\ndotnet test clio-ring/ClioRing.Tests -c Release (157 passed); Windows x64 NativeAOT publish OK\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"067bea3a0714f5bbfdef77da17d96103ba7fbb4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/067bea3a0714f5bbfdef77da17d96103ba7fbb4b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technolo