ENG-102112 Gate-2 fixes for the review round: e2e gate placement, fallback set, prompt pins\n\n- create e2e: the package gate runs before the try, so an Ignored run schedules no\n  cleanup (its describe would be refused too and could turn the Ignore into a failure).\n- The e2e gate also recognises the requirement refusals clio throws before the call\n  (package missing, below the floor), and its message no longer names a fixed version\n  as the requirement.\n- list-user-tasks names the older-package fallback positively: EmailTemplateUserTask and\n  ApprovalUserTask only; every other dedicated task updates the package instead.\n- The create and modify prompt carve-outs are pinned; the modify test is named for both\n  page blocks.\n\nReview: gate 2, single combined lens (one module, test code and description text).\nValidated: dotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory=Unit&(Module=McpServer|Module=Common)\" (8445 passed);\nboth e2e refusal tests green on net8.0 and net10.0 against a 1.6.6.88 stand.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6c4374f919bd99567ad6fa1cdfa948e3adf211c9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/6c4374f919bd99567ad6fa1cdfa948e3adf211c9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/25c056453eaefbae3e4dcd52ff315fbab128b9f0","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-krestov","id":180284958,"login":"d-krestov","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7uHg","