flag on through a step first, so they prove\n  the key binds; fail-on-warning YAML keys covered; duplicate options/global assertions dropped\n- McpHostCommandOptionsTests: pin the exact warning text, AAA markers, drop a duplicate assertion\n- McpServerIgnoredFailOnFlagsE2ETests: wait up to 10 s for the stderr line instead of racing the SDK''s\n  stderr reader; Allure description and steps\n\nValidated: dotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory=Unit&(Module=Core|Module=Command|Module=McpServer)\"\n(12268 passed, 15 skipped); dotnet test clio.mcp.e2e --filter FullyQualifiedName~McpServerIgnoredFailOnFlagsE2ETests\n(net8.0 + net10.0 passed)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7246a8bbf1a9512bb2b2efb79f3af143dd745b58","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/7246a8bbf1a9512bb2b2efb79f3af143dd745b58"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/2213c188a886df9245409ae81cfdab638cadfb4a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/290406344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tetiana-moshon","id":290406344,"login":"tetiana-moshon","node_id":"U_kgDOEU8_yA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_u