://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/1a9f91d57b631c7d6ddf38fb79b58e888784d30d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:53:27Z","email":"t.moshon@creatio.com","name":"Tetiana Moshon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T17:53:27Z","email":"t.moshon@creatio.com","name":"Tetiana Moshon"},"message":"ENG-102487: address re-review findings on the fail-on flags\n\n- BaseCommandOptions: --fail-on-error help text now says it has no effect (matches assert/hosts docs);\n  XML docs on the class and both flags, including the legacy YAML key behaviour\n- assert/hosts help and docs: a YAML step keyed --fail-on-error can only turn the flag on;\n  fail-on-error: false turns it off. BaseCommandOptionsParsingTests pin all three cases\n- MCP warning text no longer mentions worker processes (mcp-http has none); mcp-http logs it\n  through a testable McpHttpServerCommand.WarnIgnoredFailOnOptions, with tests\n- bundled-packages.md Known gaps: the strict install-log check is now always off in practice\n- tests: mcp-server.txt must not name the hidden fail-on flags; new McpServerIgnoredFailOnFlagsE2ETests\n  proves mcp-server --fail-on-error completes the handshake and warns on stderr (full-run fixture);\n  AAA markers and per-assertion because in McpHostCommandOptionsTests; the duplicate worker-spawn\n  test is dropped in favour of the existing McpWorkerCallDispatcherTests one\n\nValidated: dotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory=Unit&(Module=Core|Module=Command|Module=McpServer)\"\n(12265 passed, 15 skipped; the one failure was the new mcp-server help test, since narrowed and passing);\ndotnet test clio.mcp.e2e --filter FullyQualifiedName~McpServerIgnoredFailOnFlagsE2ETests (net8.0 + net10.0 passed)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b531f641e969e947e72cb18e050427aeab3a613","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/3b531f641e969e947e72cb18e050427aeab3a613"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/1a9f91d57b631c7d6ddf38fb79b58e888784d30d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/290406344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tetiana-moshon","id":290406344,"login":"tetiana-moshon","node_id":"U_kgDOEU8_yA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commit/1a9f91d57b631c7d6ddf38fb79b58e888784d30d","node_id":"C_kwDOCPepK9oAKDFhOWY5MWQ1N2I2MzFjN2Q2ZGRmMzhmYjc5YjU4ZTg4ODc4NGQzMGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://gith