on the fail-on-* option rename\n\n- Parsing tests: explicit Arrange step, because on every assertion, and new\n  cases for mcp-server / mcp-http and for mixing new and legacy spellings.\n- Hidden alias options: HelpText names the legacy ----fail-on-* spelling, and\n  the public alias properties get XML docs.\n- mcp-server help/docs note that --fail-on-error applies only to installs run\n  in the server process, not to tool calls run in a child worker.\n- mcp-http help/docs list both flags; mcp-http joins the manual-help\n  consistency test.\n\nValidated: dotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory=Unit&(Module=Command|Module=Core|Module=McpServer)\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4e927de026eded5681f5158f2e28a91f8a965776","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/4e927de026eded5681f5158f2e28a91f8a965776"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/e678d9326778187243bf8fc78d1eb79ac0a7eb8e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/290406344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tetiana-moshon","id":290406344,"login":"tetiana-moshon","node_id":"U_kgDOEU8_yA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subsc