d_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/447b048c98b7f50ad22562a9f1abdd4fbdcf4db7/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:04:41Z","email":"t.moshon@creatio.com","name":"Tetiana Moshon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T14:15:12Z","email":"t.moshon@creatio.com","name":"Tetiana Moshon"},"message":"ENG-102481: Fix --fail-on-error / --fail-on-warning long names\n\nBaseCommandOptions declared the long names with their leading dashes\n(\"--fail-on-error\"), so CommandLineParser accepted only \"----fail-on-error\"\nand rejected the documented \"clio assert fs --fail-on-error\" as unknown.\n\n- Rename the long names to fail-on-error / fail-on-warning.\n- Keep the old \"----\" spellings working through hidden alias properties\n  (kebab-case alias pattern from AGENTS.md).\n- Drop the BaseCommandOptions exclusion from\n  ManualHelpFile_ShouldListVisibleOptionsAndOmitHiddenOnes and cover hosts too.\n- Document both flags in assert help/docs and correct hosts help/docs: the\n  flags are accepted but have no effect on assert or hosts (only package\n  installs read GlobalContext.FailOnError; nothing reads FailOnWarning).\n- Add BaseCommandOptionsParsingTests parsing real verb lines.\n\nValidated: dotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory=Unit&(Module=Command|Module=Core)\"\nValidated: dotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory=Unit&Module=Common\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f49a30ac8685688fe20dd772daac74a882d607c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies