vered surfaces.\n\nArchive cut from crt-process-builder ffb225d7 (tag crtprocessbuilder-1.6.6.83),\nrestamped in 618e293f; the four pins were refreshed by rebundle-process-builder.ps1.\nThe service surface is unchanged, so the two security counts stay. The\n[RequiresPackage] floor stays 1.6.6.77: the tool contract advertises nothing new.\n\nE2E: MetaPathConditionToolE2ETests gains the upper-case case (minimum 1.6.6.83).\nKnowledge: the meta-path record now carries the GUID-case fact.\n\nValidated: dotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj -f net10.0 --filter \"TestCategory=Unit&(Module=Common|Module=McpServer|Module=Command)\" (13759 passed);\nMetaPathConditionToolE2ETests 6/6 on net10.0 and net8.0 against Creatio with 1.6.6.83.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"1015f166afdae1fac75bff4810d49b37ccd31d99","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/1015f166afdae1fac75bff4810d49b37ccd31d99"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/743a40a3d385adf8e5e5a4c3e22c5a5d3f53cbb4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-krestov","id":180284958,"login":"d-krestov","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7uHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/starred{/owner}{/repo