s_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-krestov","id":180284958,"login":"d-krestov","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7uHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/7860366ae49643f380d8cbd1c9b8698ad7c7c93a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T11:41:58Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T11:41:58Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"message":"ENG-102333 Review: per-tool next step in the refusal, timing not a ban\n\nArtemKulykov (inline): the long-operation refusal named restart-status for\nevery family, which sends a timed-out restart-by-credentials - same\nRestart family, not reportable by restart-status - into a not-found it\ncannot leave. LongOperationNextStep now names the route that exists for\nthe refused tool (it already receives toolName): compile-status,\nrestart-status, describe-environment with the same uri/login/password for\na credentials restart, list-app-sections for create-app-section,\nlist-packages for the installs.\n\na-trofimchuk: \"never restart on that answer alone\" read as a permanent\nban, while a package compile''s activation still needs a restart after the\ncompile ends. The compile-status note and description and the workspace\ntemplate now say: until the compile has had time to finish (a few minutes;\na full one up to about 20) do not rely on last-compilation-log, or restart\non it, before then. The liveness-probe rationale now also covers a kept\nstarter, whose call is meant to keep running.\n\nValidated:\ndotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory=Unit&Module=McpServer\"\n  (6038 passed, 0 failed, 2 not executed)\ndotnet test clio.mcp.e2e/clio.mcp.e2e.csproj --filter \"FullyQualifiedName~CompileCreatioClientTimeoutE2ETests|FullyQualifiedName~CompileCreatioToolE2ETests|FullyQualifiedName~RestartToolE2ETests\"\n  (14 passed on net10.0, 14 on net8.0)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f816e281ef8db23dc01d9e1bfef0f3301946408","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/2f816e281ef8db23dc01d9e1bfef0f3301946408"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/7860366ae49643f380d8cbd1c9b8698ad7c7c93a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-krestov","id":180284958,"login":"d-krestov","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7uHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/comm