39f218cc6c9c47b1014e4088ed19d3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-krestov","id":180284958,"login":"d-krestov","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7uHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/f593b26f014bba7b0a54a2db77035259135fabb9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T10:55:28Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T10:55:28Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"message":"ENG-102333 Final review: story 14 scope, restart texts, e2e control call\n\nFinal pre-ready review (3 lenses over the whole PR): no Blocker or High.\n- Medium: story 14 still asked a cancelled sticky worker to stop issuing\n  backend requests, which would undo this fix. Its goal and AC-05 now cover\n  polls and reads only and name the starter exception; AC-03 is ticked;\n  the sprint-tracker note no longer calls the question undecided.\n- The direct-worker e2e gains an uncancelled control call on the same\n  worker that must reach the stub''s login: a fast completion signal alone\n  would also come from a setup that cannot compile at all.\n- restart-by-environment-name''s description and the compile prompt say\n  what to do after a client-side timeout; restart-status''s not-found note\n  routes describe-environment through clio-run and gives the warm-up time;\n  the long-operation refusal names the status tools that exist; the\n  compile-status note and description cover full compiles (about 20 min)\n  and say never to restart on last-compilation-log alone, as does the\n  workspace template.\n- mcp-server docs/help: a long operation keeps its worker when the client\n  stops waiting. Knowledge records cross-linked; a test message says the\n  lifetime bound is 65 minutes; a CancellationTokenSource is disposed.\n\nValidated:\ndotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory=Unit\"\n  (15686 passed, 0 failed, 25 not executed - platform/explicit)\ndotnet test clio.mcp.e2e/clio.mcp.e2e.csproj --filter \"FullyQualifiedName~CompileCreatioClientTimeoutE2ETests|FullyQualifiedName~CompileCreatioToolE2ETests|FullyQualifiedName~RestartToolE2ETests\"\n  (14 passed on net10.0, 14 on net8.0)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3b04ca60d344d374c7d0102bbac3ace66e96c8d6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/3b04ca60d344d374c7d0102bbac3ace66e96c8d6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/f593b26f014bba7b0a54a2db77035259135fabb9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-krestov","id":180284958,"login":"d