received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/5d018a28c9632963944a78dabb41fc6f61623293/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T10:26:26Z","email":"t.moshon@creatio.com","name":"Tetiana Moshon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T10:26:26Z","email":"t.moshon@creatio.com","name":"Tetiana Moshon"},"message":"ENG-102433: stop \"alias for\" prose from marking manual help as an alias shim\n\nCommandHelpRenderer.ParseSections treated any help file containing \"alias for\"\nas an alias shim, so create-entity-schema, update-entity-schema,\nmodify-entity-schema-column and assert ignored their manual .txt in --help and\nin the generated docs. Only the legacy-heading marker now identifies a shim.\n\nThe three entity-schema .txt files are refreshed against their visible\n[Option] attributes (ENG-101526 options included, hidden aliases omitted) and\ncarry the content of the previous hand-written docs; the four docs/commands\npages are regenerated from them. Tests pin the shim rule, the manual rendering,\nthe committed docs and the .txt option lists.\n\nValidated: dotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory=Unit&Module=Core\" (650 passed)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c563080a897a3b29862278af7dd0c0673cf054ca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/c563080a897a3b29862278af7dd0c0673cf054ca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/5d018a28c9632963944a78dabb41fc6f61623293","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"un