r7uHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/d213dd3f94dfaa58237555a88dc804f2a9ace63e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:55:05Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:55:05Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"message":"ENG-102333 Review: undated verdict, all six families, SDK pin\n\nPre-PR review (3 lenses, both commits) - fixes:\n- last-compilation-log reads the latest FINISHED compile and carries no\n  time, so every place that names it as the not-found fallback now says\n  it can be an earlier compile''s verdict while one still runs and must not\n  drive a restart (High, found by two lenses). The not-found note lists no\n  reasons any more; a record also ends some minutes after its compile.\n- restart-status''s not-found note no longer reads as \"nothing ran\" and\n  points to describe-environment instead of a second restart.\n- TryKeepAbandonedStarter (renamed: it marks and logs) and ADR 3.2a now\n  argue for all six starter families, not only the two with a status\n  poll, and record the two accepted trade-offs: a cancel no longer stops\n  work that reached the worker before its first Creatio request, and a\n  kept worker is bounded by its signal, supervision and the lifetime bound.\n- New e2e talks to a real clio mcp-server --worker and pins that a call\n  cancelled right behind its request still sends the completion signal\n  (measured: the filter ran and signalled at once, nothing started).\n- The curated compile-creatio contract carries the rule as an anti-pattern;\n  the existing not-found e2e cases assert the new notes; a duplicated unit\n  test folded into the existing one; stale comment and descriptions fixed;\n  the e2e-cancellation fact moved to its own knowledge record; story 14\n  AC-03 and the sprint tracker note the decision.\n\nValidated:\ndotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory=Unit\"\n  (15390 passed, 0 failed, 25 not executed - platform/explicit, none new)\ndotnet test clio.mcp.e2e/clio.mcp.e2e.csproj --filter \"FullyQualifiedName~CompileCreatioClientTimeoutE2ETests|FullyQualifiedName~CompileCreatioToolE2ETests|FullyQualifiedName~RestartToolE2ETests\"\n  (14 passed on net10.0, 14 on net8.0)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4a41fe90e1f53adf4f71f5fe26bc63e77e5ae623","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/4a41fe90e1f53adf4f71f5fe26bc63e77e5ae623"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/d213dd3f94dfaa58237555a88dc804f2a9ace63e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-krestov","id":180284958,"login":"d-krestov","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7uHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"htt