/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commit/79b44dc4b75eb5b0df57acb8939629751b18ab37","node_id":"C_kwDOCPepK9oAKDc5YjQ0ZGM0Yjc1ZWI1YjBkZjU3YWNiODkzOTYyOTc1MWIxOGFiMzc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commit/a096054eaa52cf566506135854edd1e2b791c7ee","sha":"a096054eaa52cf566506135854edd1e2b791c7ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/a096054eaa52cf566506135854edd1e2b791c7ee"},{"html_url":"https://github.com/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commit/91866dcc4f780ccbd76f6c4e46589e07f6a29ff8","sha":"91866dcc4f780ccbd76f6c4e46589e07f6a29ff8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/91866dcc4f780ccbd76f6c4e46589e07f6a29ff8"}],"sha":"79b44dc4b75eb5b0df57acb8939629751b18ab37","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/79b44dc4b75eb5b0df57acb8939629751b18ab37"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-krestov","id":180284958,"login":"d-krestov","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7uHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/2405f388312c4f94041f65d9c469ea9b6fec50df/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:26:33Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T09:26:33Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"message":"ENG-102333 Keep a sticky worker whose starter''s caller stopped waiting\n\nAn MCP client whose own request timeout fires before clio''s 150 s\nin-progress answer cancels compile-creatio with notifications/cancelled.\nThe parent reaped the sticky worker on that cancellation, killing the only\nprocess holding the compile''s record, so compile-status answered not-found\nwhile the compile ran to completion on the stand (reproduced on a .NET\nFramework stand with Claude Code and MCP_TOOL_TIMEOUT=60000).\n\nA starter cancelled after its request was written now keeps its worker,\nmarked abandoned so the next call proves it alive first - the decision the\npoll path already made. A cancellation before the write, during spawn or\nhandshake, or on a worker that stopped being reachable still releases it.\nThe change sits in the branch every sticky starter shares: compile-creatio,\nrestart-by-environment-name, restart-by-credentials, install-process-builder,\ninstall-dashboards-migrator and create-app-section. Recorded in ADR 3.2a.\n\ncompile-status''s not-found note now says a missing record does not mean no\ncompile ran and names last-compilation-log; the compile-creatio and\ncompile-status descriptions, the curated compile-creatio contract and the\nworkspace template say what to do after a client-side timeout.\n\nValidated:\ndotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory=Unit\"\n  (15391 passed, 0 failed, 25 skipped)\ndotnet test clio.mcp.e2e/clio.mcp.e2e.csproj --filter \"FullyQualifiedName~CompileCreatioClientTimeoutE2ETests|FullyQualifiedName~CompileCreatioToolE2ETests\"\n  (9 passed on net10.0, 9 on net8.0)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7c469995d0f406b0aa40675b236a552ebe129d79","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/7c469995d0f406b0aa40675b236a552ebe129d79"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/2405f388312c4f94041f65d9c469ea9b6fec50df","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-krestov","id":180284958,"login":"d-krestov","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7uHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commit/2405f388312c4f94041f65d9c469ea9b6fec50df","node_id":"C_kwDOCPepK9oAKDI0MDVmMzg4MzEyYzRmOTQwNDFmNjVkOWM0NjllYTliNmZlYzUwZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commit/a096054eaa52cf566506135854edd1e2b791c7ee","sha":"a096054eaa52cf566506135854edd1e2b791c7ee","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/a096054eaa52cf566506135854edd1e2b791c7ee"}],"sha":"2405f388312c4f94041f65d9c469ea9b6fec50df","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/2405f388312c4f94041f65d9c469ea9b6fec50df"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-krestov","id":180284958,"login":"d-krestov","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7uHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/91866dcc4f780ccbd76f6c4e46589e07f6a29ff8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T08:14:44Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T08:14:44Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"message":"#ENG-102114 Raise the CrtProcessBuilder floor of create / modify / modify-as-new-version to 1.6.6.77 (review)\n\nThe contracts now promise modify-path condition names and the hand-written meta-path check, both first in\nCrtProcessBuilder 1.6.6.77, but the [RequiresPackage] floor still said 1.6.6.40. Convergence refuses anything below\nthe bundled archive while it is healthy; in its degraded modes (an unreadable archive, a pre-release version) the\nfloor is the only gate, and a 1.6.6.40-1.6.6.76 server would store a modify-path name verbatim (\"Expression\nexpected\" at save) and save a meta path on an unread column green. modify-as-new-version shares the operations\narray, so it moves too. History line added above each attribute; the contracts'' stated version, the as-new-version\nfloor history, the attribute tests, two E2E skip messages and the capability map follow. The modify contract pays\nfor the new words by dropping the multiInstanceOptions field list from that parenthesis (byte budget).\n\nValidated: dotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj -f net10.0 --filter \"TestCategory=Unit&(Module=Command|Module=McpServer|Module=Common)\" (13720 passed)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"15c29e2a5369c3159fe320e62afa649430f77bce","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/15c29e2a5369c3159fe320e62afa649430f77bce"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/91866dcc4f780ccbd76f6c4e46589e07f6a29ff8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-krestov","id":180284958,"login":"d-krestov","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7uHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/us