.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/df805eb0bbdb28922bbe3e18848d617894b43c7f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T07:47:59Z","email":"t.moshon@creatio.com","name":"Tetiana Moshon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T07:47:59Z","email":"t.moshon@creatio.com","name":"Tetiana Moshon"},"message":"ENG-101526: pin the global Hidden-option help filter across the command catalog\n\nReview follow-up (approvals by Alexandr-Kravchuk and kamil-mikosz-creatio, DR1):\nthe renderer''s Hidden filter is kept on purpose. A catalog-wide\nTestCaseSource now checks that every command''s generated help lists each\noption that is not Hidden and none of the long names that only a Hidden\noption declares. Removing the filter fails 204 of 257 commands.\n\nValidated: dotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory=Unit&Module=Core\" (634 passed)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2ed2b7be21d53fd309d007e2a9e530f4c33680f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/2ed2b7be21d53fd309d007e2a9e530f4c33680f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/df805eb0bbdb28922bbe3e18848d617894b43c7f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/290406344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/tetiana-moshon","id":290406344,"login":"tetiana-moshon","node_id":"U_kgDOEU8_yA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.githu