s://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/31629613cfb06b99a8f5c20ac4781de4415df531/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T07:36:47Z","email":"t.moshon@creatio.com","name":"Tetiana Moshon"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-07T07:36:47Z","email":"t.moshon@creatio.com","name":"Tetiana Moshon"},"message":"ENG-101526: report operation errors with their source and file-local index\n\nAddress kamil-mikosz-creatio''s approval review on PR #1758:\n- Field-level errors for operations that came from --operations or\n  --operations-file now name that source and count the index within it\n  (\"--operations-file ''<path>'' item at index 0 has unknown field ...\")\n  instead of the index merged across all sources. --operation payloads\n  keep the \"Operation payload at index N\" wording.\n- Tests: file-local and --operations-local indexes for field errors,\n  UTF-16 BE file with a BOM, invalid UTF-16 LE (odd byte count, lone\n  surrogate), and a relative --operations-file path resolved from the\n  current directory.\n- update-entity-schema.md documents the source-local index.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"eac2daa8c0cef19dc88bd93d99a078ae5515ec8b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/eac2daa8c0cef19dc88bd93d99a078ae5515ec8b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/31629613cfb06b99a8f5c20ac4781de4415df531","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/290406344?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/following{/othe