/api.github.com/users/d-krestov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-krestov","id":180284958,"login":"d-krestov","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7uHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/3489aa80f0ae9f1df3e4ced375d462bc8c43c317/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T15:05:26Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T15:05:26Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"message":"#ENG-102114 Bundle CrtProcessBuilder 1.6.6.78 (gate-3 review); E2E asserts the token and the column, covers a mapping; descriptions say \"exactly\"\n\nBundles CrtProcessBuilder 1.6.6.78, packed from crt-process-builder commit ff7d9ff4 (tag crtprocessbuilder-1.6.6.78;\nrestamp 2c9118a9): the token walker reads ''[##]'' as the platform does, name expansion stops at the stored-text bound,\nEnsureCanonical is now EnsureAcceptedSpelling. Service surface unchanged, security counts untouched.\n\n- modify/create-business-process and the modify prompt: a hand-written meta path is spelled EXACTLY as the platform\n  does (every segment dot-separated, prefix optional); the mapping clause says prefix optional and loaded column;\n  the unresolvable-reference wording matches create''s. Gate phrase \"every segment dot-separated\" kept; the\n  modify contract stays under the byte budget by dropping a redundant clause.\n- MetaPathConditionToolE2ETests: the misspelling refusal must hand back the described token, the unread-column\n  refusal must name DoNotUseCall, arrange guards moved out of Assert, and a new mapping-expression case.\n- Knowledge: build-path-conditions (modify path in description and applies-to, column row now by name, three\n  consequences), read-data-column-selection (what was measured vs traced), platform-refuses (the third check is\n  named), hand-written-meta-path (description matches the body; the designer-echo refusal kept deliberately).\n- McpCapabilityMap: the modify entry says conditions take names and how a hand-written meta path is spelled.\n\nValidated: dotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj -f net10.0 --filter \"TestCategory=Unit&(Module=Common|Module=McpServer|Module=Core)\" (8695 passed)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"150359500cf3c65ddff88e248bb088094a359188","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/trees/150359500cf3c65ddff88e248bb088094a359188"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/git/commits/3489aa80f0ae9f1df3e4ced375d462bc8c43c317","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-krestov","id":180284958,"login":"d-krestov","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7uHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","su