/api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/tetiana-moshon","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commit/948d5d8591d9e129976bc1456535c892dc0453f4","node_id":"C_kwDOCPepK9oAKDk0OGQ1ZDg1OTFkOWUxMjk5NzZiYzE0NTY1MzVjODkyZGMwNDUzZjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commit/a12209079fb4600e3cd8b84909071b656f5ed23b","sha":"a12209079fb4600e3cd8b84909071b656f5ed23b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/a12209079fb4600e3cd8b84909071b656f5ed23b"}],"sha":"948d5d8591d9e129976bc1456535c892dc0453f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/948d5d8591d9e129976bc1456535c892dc0453f4"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/180284958?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/d-krestov","id":180284958,"login":"d-krestov","node_id":"U_kgDOCr7uHg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/d-krestov","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Technologies-Foundation/clio/commits/2e479823f30f1659b54162282998e72b0a777da6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-06T13:23:12Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-06T13:23:12Z","email":"d.krestov@creatio.com","name":"d-krestov"},"message":"#ENG-102114 Bundle CrtProcessBuilder 1.6.6.77 (review rounds 2-3); knowledge, capability map and E2E follow the accepted spellings\n\nBundles CrtProcessBuilder 1.6.6.77, packed from crt-process-builder commit 01c3b246ed2d10e6c430e7d4d4a32667d58d05ed\n(tag crtprocessbuilder-1.6.6.77; restamp 94970b6c). 1.6.6.76 was cut on this branch only and installed on one\ntest stand; it was never published.\n\n- Knowledge: build-path-conditions-name-their-parameters (modify path expands too; a hand-written meta path is\n  checked, prefix optional), a-read-data-column-selection-... (the UId form is refused from 1.6.6.77),\n  the-platform-refuses-a-bad-flow-condition-at-save (the ENG-102114 exception: why this check is the package''s).\n- docs/McpCapabilityMap.md: the create-business-process entry no longer says the modify path has no expansion.\n- create-business-process no longer quotes the platform''s unresolved-reference sentence the package now pre-empts;\n  modify-business-process says \"prefix optional\" (35047 / 34656 of 35072 bytes).\n- ModifyBusinessProcess_ShouldCarryThePhraseTheGuidanceGatesOn pins \"every segment dot-separated\", the phrase\n  clio-knowledge gates modify-path name expansion on.\n- E2E: success read through McpCommandExecutionParser; the prefix-less spelling is accepted and stored as written;\n  a column outside readData.columns is refused.\n\nValidated: dotnet test clio.tests/clio.tests.csproj --filter \"TestCategory=Unit&(Module=Common|Module=McpServer|Module=Core)\" (8695 passed)\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"818dbc8654338d462d9a57c58c24dfd8980739fd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Advance-Techno