 resetting integrationsEndpointsPermissions\nand integrationsReadPermissions to undefined, wiping Kessel-granted permissions\nfor v2 org admins. Preserve already-granted permissions in pending handlers.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqjbHrCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAKOQQAEG0gPrG/6iT9PJyBUbYgLkW\nizOSr23khBxZSNapw128jvG4hQTeGa5gCSwcnAj7el0m8ZcAodrECBF2cqI/Eo8N\nLks6vtQwrfqOlwRqdHSu9deE/wZCUHnbWfXBcRtHJZClyIJ56oVFecMARrGWpe1d\nymGHEDTQWIAp84P2ltIiyS7LiSjc6ZDpBkMT27q8HSXr4XYqk2fzbNUq63DFJLt7\nVsIn0TV+Q6DM15jPSCVl9R+M3NYmb60BuzoFiZ7JhueFYDXDYa22CU7O10K+2ZUZ\nrOjmbDdzbDXcaAZ6WSyI7RtSZWHEi2fKaWloVrz0PemBnJ3gU+ZmCdmWahA9O4Ew\nZpkWBNLOFIc6g2uXZdFGJxoFL24iXPVvpgI7l5H4ebYm59+RhWQDaqrOzsuSYM8d\npG/MbkxAEACV55g5lIxxPnJBPX6JfsUktRW7R6GGrUP3NA1oIM1QDh/OUaVYgt6A\nu2C71wanFf550XmLuv5avYQOWfRjMEyqmJbv2NmDBQNCV53B/SoSl7vbe/j0THvO\nQ9G/QsTWafPnQ6PXqoPJppj7XhnrWaFUa0+fqJfa4mDqIze7SBzaEyEmYhGpWwx0\nXGw41stjJkExS5hXAAUuY/KZuBoMK+6FphEwPkjVrm7OZsoDlLrAOzFGtK7VcdKP\nRaDDeRbj4Uf1jZR4+RMB\n=CGgR\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-25T15:17:00Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/commit/e5bcb55e015b34cf52098d64e17bb7c65c44a975","node_id":"C_kwDOCRa7d9oAKGU1YmNiNTVlMDE1YjM0Y2Y1MjA5OGQ2NGUxN2JiN2M2NWM0NGE5NzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/commit/fbdb2422e736b5433a84eadb93f323855e3b3409","sha":"fbdb2422e736b5433a84eadb93f323855e3b3409","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/commits/fbdb2422e736b5433a84eadb93f323855e3b3409"}],"sha":"e5bcb55e015b34cf52098d64e17bb7c65c44a975","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/commits/e5bcb55e015b34cf52098d64e17bb7c65c44a975"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86322239?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aferd","id":86322239,"login":"aferd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MzIyMjM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/commits/fbdb2422e736b5433a84eadb93f323855e3b3409/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T14:59:44Z","email":"86322239+aferd@users.noreply.github.com","name":"alex"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T14:59:44Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"feat(RHCLOUD-50185): Adopt isKesselEnabled for v1/v2 permission detection (#1516)\n\n* feat(RHCLOUD-50185): Adopt isKesselEnabled for v1/v2 permission detection\n\nReplace useFlag(''platform.rbac.workspaces'') with\nuseFlag(''platform.chrome.kessel'') in PermissionsChecker. This aligns\nwith Chrome''s centralized Kessel detection per RHCLOUD-49749. On\nFedRAMP/ITLess environments, the flag is false so v1 is always used.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(RHCLOUD-50185): document v1 wildcard fallback in permission loading example\n\nKessel v2 does not support wildcard expansion, so the Kessel-enabled\nbranch also loads v1 permissions for Org Admins and legacy roles.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0e3722aba3fcb95c45ec96d6de01a78aecb47b88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/git/trees/0e3722aba3fcb95c45ec96d6de01a78aecb47b88"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/git/commits/fbdb2422e736b5433a84eadb93f323855e3b3409","verification":{"payload":"tree 0e3722aba3fcb95c45ec96d6de01a78aecb47b88\nparent 0e627ba7d111475a1fc5902d7455a4ee2707a157\nauthor alex <86322239+aferd@users.noreply.github.com> 1787237984 -0400\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1787237984 -0400\n\nfeat(RHCLOUD-50185): Adopt isKesselEnabled for v1/v2 permission detection (#1516)\n\n* feat(RHCLOUD-50185): Adopt isKesselEnabled for v1/v2 permission detection\n\nReplace useFlag(''platform.rbac.workspaces'') with\nuseFlag(''platform.chrome.kessel'') in PermissionsChecker. This aligns\nwith Chrome''s centralized Kessel detection per RHCLOUD-49749. On\nFedRAMP/ITLess environments, the flag is false so v1 is always used.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* docs(RHCLOUD-50185): document v1 wildcard fallback in permission loading example\n\nKessel v2 does not support wildcard expansion, so the Kessel-enabled\nbranch also loads v1 permissions for Org Admins and legacy roles.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqhxZgCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAVRsQACvdDCtBnlNvCdAi3jk6e+ux\nWRqQXq9MdS3wVZlaY/xtbyqkAsnUEhCPnnGDdYwrBFat6Fz1KwcuvjDpjXgks4Zz\nvTMPGSKmNfJreyZOnjsXQlKP0werX70omXEuKsH4BNTOSb+qfEqiB9ZJNBhtWj7m\nCDrNG1jqnyffX4B5LsiVmAh1w+ZB5Xpff8pN8APwZWOd/I9togCyR1i4JmXpxcyB\nZg94tWB5LEFHbYzbmjz/icz9o7OQrCZwd5mC7IQ+egpVooaMj2cTPDLwsyU+ba8V\nR8k0S/o8ftitYt1cAHVdR1KRZJ1NNBQXpnvrqQMqJVAgvS9PY4gJ2T++6j0vQ8lC\nuJrGimUfFIWeihjTRRACvL80H0hKUGDzAIrXGgZHmCYnmN39Oz5/HLrgUvIeT5VZ\nVcgUK5Ue5NAldZQibiI54PmNFlu/f03GGvw1anOwb9sSAEVv+mbym/IlwQbcpmy4\nxFBKMkiooXuGXKAV9OZgYK1Jo3ylDiSwpFRWr3UnR6DWh37f7AZ2Qaj0k6DnlNWf\n2nHcf7XNE3hK171ANVyxa365F9q39mmqArtgHFq/xuTFIP6L5Yok2vUjMe5I0ryI\nWkul7Mgw0f88V/ia/LgB4cDYKFR0DN9TYrqgDIPdVyemteIlTYALq+7lEuUpsDoV\n6Lpms0S4hLUq2ISoWhhM\n=IKzn\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-08-20T14:59:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","