,"site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/commits/9ab19e6ab940a5a610bc57befb1bd03d0964a8aa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-20T17:52:39Z","email":"86322239+aferd@users.noreply.github.com","name":"alex"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-20T17:52:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(RHCLOUD-49426): add Kessel RBAC providers to integrations widget (#1502)\n\n* fix(RHCLOUD-49426): add Kessel RBAC providers to integrations widget and bump kessel SDK\n\nThe IntegrationsWidget was missing KesselRbacAccessProvider and\nAccessCheck.Provider, causing \"useKesselRbacAccess must be used within\nKesselRbacAccessProvider\" errors. Also bumps @project-kessel/react-kessel-access-check\nto ^0.5.2 to fix the workspaces call issue (RHINENG-28784).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* test(RHCLOUD-49426): add Storybook stories for IntegrationsWidget\n\nAdds three stories covering the empty state, populated state with\nintegration counts, and feature-flagged items (PagerDuty, Email).\nUses MSW handlers to mock the API endpoints and a custom store\ndecorator for Redux state.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n* fix(RHCLOUD-49426): fix lint errors in IntegrationsWidget stories\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Opus 4.6 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"37e533aca5ff45dd4cee8f83cc7021876e6b8029","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/git/trees/37e533aca5ff45dd4cee8f83cc7021876e6b8029"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/git/commits/9ab19e6ab940a5a610bc57befb1bd03d0964a8aa","verification":{"pa