age":"fix: resolve TypeScript errors in CardSelect.stories.tsx\n\nUse LegacyField type from data-driven-forms which allows custom\ncomponent props, fixing TS2322 errors from the stricter Schema\ngeneric in @data-driven-forms/react-form-renderer 4.1.14.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"05cedca968f5f4538605c56c444c65cce4b50a98","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/git/trees/05cedca968f5f4538605c56c444c65cce4b50a98"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/git/commits/2001b7f2333b9d7a61d88a1e223943e4e16e942e","verification":{"payload":"tree 05cedca968f5f4538605c56c444c65cce4b50a98\nparent b0ab386d5bae03495b4e2ea1fb05526ae6db50dc\nauthor Riccardo Forina <rforina@redhat.com> 1782828471 +0200\ncommitter Riccardo Forina <rforina@redhat.com> 1782977303 +0200\n\nfix: resolve TypeScript errors in CardSelect.stories.tsx\n\nUse LegacyField type from data-driven-forms which allows custom\ncomponent props, fixing TS2322 errors from the stricter Schema\ngeneric in @data-driven-forms/react-form-renderer 4.1.14.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.6 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\niJEEABYKADkWIQRE1q80stcRSNHz0KkPA+r+kECdxwUCakYTFxsUgAAAAAAEAA5t\nYW51MiwyLjUrMS4xMiwwLDMACgkQDwPq/pBAncdCTAD9E7B7Fb28dCnTj1CBA82t\nP+DsToJ/7bqFhrCstMpmd3MBAJIW1yAM5AjimjPNQF5fxciWg8dSXi+iGv2x9dGI\nNNsE\n=W6Zc\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-02T07:28:30Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/966316?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riccardo-forina/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riccardo-forina/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riccardo-forina/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/riccardo-forina/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/riccardo-forina"