}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/commit/9a12bfc50ed70e23827c4e63edf32d8adaf4a2ac","node_id":"C_kwDOCRa7d9oAKDlhMTJiZmM1MGVkNzBlMjM4MjdjNGU2M2VkZjMyZDhhZGFmNGEyYWM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/commit/b6b9e8f6b476c593b014201cdd3b9bf137a61464","sha":"b6b9e8f6b476c593b014201cdd3b9bf137a61464","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/commits/b6b9e8f6b476c593b014201cdd3b9bf137a61464"}],"sha":"9a12bfc50ed70e23827c4e63edf32d8adaf4a2ac","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/commits/9a12bfc50ed70e23827c4e63edf32d8adaf4a2ac"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86322239?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aferd","id":86322239,"login":"aferd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MzIyMjM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/commits/b6b9e8f6b476c593b014201cdd3b9bf137a61464/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T16:40:15Z","email":"aferdina@redhat.com","name":"alex"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T16:40:15Z","email":"aferdina@redhat.com","name":"alex"},"message":"fix(RBAC): Fix v2 org wildcard permission handling and race condition\n\nThis commit fixes two critical issues with RBAC v2 wildcard permissions:\n\n1. **Race condition fix**: Split permission loading into separate effects\n   - v1 orgs: Only depend on [isV2Org, getUserPermissions, dispatch]\n   - v2 orgs: Depend on [isV2Org, isKesselLoading, kesselPermissions, getUserPermissions, dispatch]\n   - Prevents effect from running 5x when Kessel loading state changes\n\n2. **Missing wildcard check**: Add integrations:*:* to read permission check\n   - Write permission already checked for integrations:*:* wildcard\n   - Read permission was only checking integrations:*:read and integrations:endpoints:read\n   - Now checks integrations:*:* first, matching write permission logic\n   - Fixes org admins being denied access despite having integrations:*:* wildcard\n\n3. **OR logic fix**: Prioritize new permission value in reducer\n   - Changed from: state.integrationsEndpointsPermissions || integrationsEndpointsPermissions\n   - Changed to: integrationsEndpointsPermissions || state.integrationsEndpointsPermissions\n   - Ensures v1 wildcard permissions override false Kessel values\n\nRelated: RHCLOUD-48396\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"26d8332089a0c39d2e66450532732d3ac6ad2c83","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/git/trees/26d8332089a0c39d2e66450532732d3ac6ad2c83"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/git/commits/b6b9e8f6b476c593b014201cdd3b9bf137a61464","verification":{"payload":"tree 26d8332089a0c39d2e66450532732d3ac6ad2c83\nparent de783ef9072f579a5d9dfe316a7cb0102ae86fb4\nauthor alex <aferdina@redhat.com> 1781541615 -0400\ncommitter alex <aferdina@redhat.com> 1781541615 -0400\n\nfix(RBAC): Fix v2 org wildcard permission handling and race condition\n\nThis commit fixes two critical issues with RBAC v2 wildcard permissions:\n\n1. **Race condition fix**: Split permission loading into separate effects\n   - v1 orgs: Only depend on [isV2Org, getUserPermissions, dispatch]\n   - v2 orgs: Depend on [isV2Org, isKesselLoading, kesselPermissions, getUserPermissions, dispatch]\n   - Prevents effect from running 5x when Kessel loading state changes\n\n2. **Missing wildcard check**: Add integrations:*:* to read permission check\n   - Write permission already checked for integrations:*:* wildcard\n   - Read permission was only checking integrations:*:read and integrations:endpoints:read\n   - Now checks integrations:*:* first, matching write permission logic\n   - Fixes org admins being denied access despite having integrations:*:* wildcard\n\n3. **OR logic fix**: Prioritize new permission value in reducer\n   - Changed from: state.integrationsEndpointsPermissions || integrationsEndpointsPermissions\n   - Changed to: integrationsEndpointsPermissions || state.integrationsEndpointsPermissions\n   - Ensures v1 wildcard permissions override false Kessel values\n\nRelated: RHCLOUD-48396\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgl/GNrHKu7GjAJDa9UU6gNAsv4/\nRIVSJ9eCCvknS5uJMAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQBRdNVGszqM3MMy1nL4djrrak6CaOdFLAJiEmXGQu3NRdLk8hsJTeSZ8QHBkERbpsv\nSAGLsdGCFFWIe59WgMAw8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-15T16:40:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86322239?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aferd","id":86322239,"login":"aferd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MzIyMjM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/commit/b6b9e8f6b476c593b014201cdd3b9bf137a61464","node_id":"C_kwDOCRa7d9oAKGI2YjllOGY2YjQ3NmM1OTNiMDE0MjAxY2RkM2I5YmYxMzdhNjE0NjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/commit/de783ef9072f579a5d9dfe316a7cb0102ae86fb4","sha":"de783ef9072f579a5d9dfe316a7cb0102ae86fb4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/commits/de783ef9072f579a5d9dfe316a7cb0102ae86fb4"}],"sha":"b6b9e8f6b476c593b014201cdd3b9bf137a61464","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/commits/b6b9e8f6b476c593b014201cdd3b9bf137a61464"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86322239?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aferd","id":86322239,"login":"aferd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MzIyMjM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/commits/de783ef9072f579a5d9dfe316a7cb0102ae86fb4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-15T15:30:39Z","email":"aferdina@redhat.com","name":"alex"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-15T15:30:39Z","email":"aferdina@redhat.com","name":"alex"},"message":"feat(RBAC): Add v1 wildcard fallback for v2 orgs\n\nFor v2 orgs, load BOTH Kessel v2 permissions AND v1 Chrome API permissions,\nthen combine them in Redux using OR logic. This ensures Org Admins and\nlegacy roles with wildcard permissions (integrations:*:*, integrations:endpoints:*)\nmaintain access when their org is migrated to v2.\n\nWhy: Kessel v2 does not currently support wildcard permission expansion.\nWithout this fallback, users with wildcard permissions would lose access\nwhen their org is migrated to v2.\n\nImplementation:\n- PermissionsChecker.tsx: Load v1 permissions even for v2 orgs\n- reducer.js: Combine permissions with OR logic in Redux state\n\nTemporary workaround: Should be removed once EITHER:\n1. Kessel v2 supports wildcard permission expansion, OR\n2. All wildcard permissions are migrated to explicit Kessel workspace relations\n\nRelated: insights-chrome PR #3362, notifications-frontend PR (same branch)\nIssue: RHCLOUD-48396\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f6ff472278a775174f31267d76d0de7270abf397","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/git/trees/f6ff472278a775174f31267d76d0de7270abf397"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/RedHatInsights/sources-ui/git/commits/de783ef9072f579a5d9dfe316a7cb0102ae86fb4","verification":{"payload":"tree f6ff472278a775174f31267d76d0de7270abf397\nparent 7d02d562dadb3034ceabf9331f923e10edf53139\nauthor alex <aferdina@redhat.com> 1781537439 -0400\ncommitter alex <aferdina@redhat.com> 1781537439 -0400\n\nfeat(RBAC): Add v1 wildcard fallback for v2 orgs\n\nFor v2 orgs, load BOTH Kessel v2 permissions AND v1 Chrome API permissions,\nthen combine them in Redux using OR logic. This ensures Org Admins and\nlegacy roles with wildcard permissions (integrations:*:*, integrations:endpoints:*)\nmaintain access when their org is migrated to v2.\n\nWhy: Kessel v2 does not currently support wildcard permission expansion.\nWithout this fallback, users with wildcard permissions would lose access\nwhen their org is migrated to v2.\n\nImplementation:\n- PermissionsChecker.tsx: Load v1 permissions even for v2 orgs\n- reducer.js: Combine permissions with OR logic in Redux state\n\nTemporary workaround: Should be removed once EITHER:\n1. Kessel v2 supports wildcard permission expansion, OR\n2. All wildcard permissions are migrated to explicit Kessel workspace relations\n\nRelated: insights-chrome PR #3362, notifications-frontend PR (same branch)\nIssue: RHCLOUD-48396\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 4.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAgl/GNrHKu7GjAJDa9UU6gNAsv4/\nRIVSJ9eCCvknS5uJMAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQKdx/UEVhe60JGO2uXBgekyAeUNNGE6Yp8M6Dg/mdnoc4jgO2ZqCygRywq2+6hG4oy\nnNL+i+yJC2wZ5zdKdM6w8=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-06-15T15:30:45Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/86322239?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aferd","id":86322239,"login":"aferd","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2MzIyMjM5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aferd/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subs