m","name":"ovh-cds"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T13:23:24Z","email":"opensource@ovh.net","name":"ovh-cds"},"message":"release(*): tin-chimpanzee\n\nSigned-off-by: ovh-cds <opensource@ovh.net>","tree":{"sha":"fb3260f5daee725ab978087a0d91e519fe60130a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/git/trees/fb3260f5daee725ab978087a0d91e519fe60130a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/git/commits/458c4b0e9664d26fda207e4f0e3a12419f136865","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/40792150?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovh-cds/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovh-cds/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovh-cds/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovh-cds/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ovh-cds","id":40792150,"login":"ovh-cds","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQwNzkyMTUw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovh-cds/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovh-cds/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovh-cds/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovh-cds/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovh-cds/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ovh-cds","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovh/manager/commit/458c4b0e9664d26fda207e4f0e3a12419f136865","node_id":"C_kwDOCUKdX9oAKDQ1OGM0YjBlOTY2NGQyNmZkYTIwN2U0ZjBlM2ExMjQxOWYxMzY4NjU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovh/manager/commit/2886e77f141fa9692dd8f1285be754f281b25d96","sha":"2886e77f141fa9692dd8f1285be754f281b25d96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/commits/2886e77f141fa9692dd8f1285be754f281b25d96"}],"sha":"458c4b0e9664d26fda207e4f0e3a12419f136865","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/commits/458c4b0e9664d26fda207e4f0e3a12419f136865"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/commits/2886e77f141fa9692dd8f1285be754f281b25d96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-07T15:46:17Z","email":"stephanie.moallic@corp.ovh.com","name":"Stephanie Moallic"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-08T12:53:37Z","email":"alexandre.dergham.ext@ovhcloud.com","name":"aderghamov"},"message":"fix(iplb): unwrap the configo''s default export on the order route\n\nClicking Order on the Load Balancer listing left the customer on a blank page\nin EU, CA and US: no form ever mounted.\n\n`loadRemote` resolves the module *namespace*, and the configo''s federated entry\nis a default export (`react-order`,\nsrc/configos/iplb/federation/vite-module-federation-pack.ts). The route handed\nthat namespace to the component as `setupIpLb`, so `$onInit` called a\nnon-callable object and threw `setupIpLb is not a function` before anything was\nrendered. The remote itself was never at fault: it loads, and it does expose\n`iplb_pack`.\n\nShaped exactly like the billing configo loader, for two toolchain reasons\nrather than style — both learned the hard way here:\n  - `get` rather than `?.`, which the legacy webpack pipeline''s acorn plugin\n    rejects in this position;\n  - `.then` rather than `async`, because the babel transform wraps an async\n    function and drops the `/* @ngInject */` annotation, leaving AngularJS to\n    infer DI from minified parameter names (`Unknown provider: _xProvider`).\n\nVerified by hand on the `dedicated` application, which is what the sidebar\nentry routes to — the `iplb` app alone does not serve this path.\n\nref: #MANAGER-22850\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Stephanie Moallic <stephanie.moallic@ovhcloud.com>","tree":{"sha":"b1b880d0f3e7e037c83f10f18607ca157b395718","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/git/trees/b1b880d0f3e7e037c83f10f18607ca157b395718"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/git/commits/2886e77f141fa9692dd8f1285be754f281b25d96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/206674836?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aderghamov/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aderghamov/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aderghamov/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aderghamov/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/aderghamov","id":206674836,"login":"aderghamov","node_id":"U_kgDODFGblA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aderghamov/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aderghamov/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aderghamov/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aderghamov/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/aderghamov/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aderghamov","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovh/manager/commit/2886e77f141fa9692dd8f1285be754f281b25d96","node_id":"C_kwDOCUKdX9oAKDI4ODZlNzdmMTQxZmE5NjkyZGQ4ZjEyODViZTc1NGYyODFiMjVkOTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovh/manager/commit/70e8349b97d3cbb9f6205f408f4d57b4fb2eb466","sha":"70e8349b97d3cbb9f6205f408f4d57b4fb2eb466","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/commits/70e8349b97d3cbb9f6205f408f4d57b4fb2eb466"}],"sha":"2886e77f141fa9692dd8f1285be754f281b25d96","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/commits/2886e77f141fa9692dd8f1285be754f281b25d96"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199581581?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/erazafimovh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/eraza