.com/users/abullet33/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abullet33/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abullet33/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abullet33/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abullet33","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/commits/271f7dfed6a275763dfd6117a04d21073e0e30b3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T13:04:55Z","email":"arthur.bullet@ovhcloud.com","name":"Arthur Bullet"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-05T11:44:23Z","email":"106544940+abullet33@users.noreply.github.com","name":"abullet33"},"message":"feat(pci-databases-analytics): handle mongodb freemium end of life\n\nDisplay an end-of-life banner on MongoDB Discovery DB2-FREE services.\n\nLet customers reactivate a shelved freemium service from the settings\npage: the \"unshelve\" link is shown when the service exposes the unshelve\ncapability (create or update) and calls the new unshelve route after a\nconfirmation modal.\n\nDrive the plan \"Edit\" link from the servicePlan capability when the\nservice exposes it, so a shelved service can still migrate to the paid\noffer. Services without it keep relying on the service capability.\n\nref: #DATATR-4134, #DATATR-4135, #DATATR-4136\nSigned-off-by: Arthur Bullet <arthur.bullet@ovhcloud.com>","tree":{"sha":"57117cc4a936ea27954f4deae8eac773373d27a4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/git/trees/57117cc4a936ea27954f4deae8eac773373d27a4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/git/commits/271f7dfed6a275763dfd6117a04d21073e0e30b3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106544940?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abullet33/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/