 Ramesh"},"message":"feat(catalog): map v8 order routes back to their v6 application\n\n2api /catalog now returns v8 order routes for the products ordered inside\nthe manager. Enterprise File Storage (#/bare-metal/storage/efs/new) is\nstill hosted by the dedicated app, so its link is rebuilt there through\nthe shell navigation (#/dedicated/netapp/new).\n\nref: #MANAGER-22688\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Sachin Ramesh <sachin.ramesh@ovhcloud.com>","tree":{"sha":"c39393a1aa6e6e0fb7d0bc71b069da0b5c297f20","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/git/trees/c39393a1aa6e6e0fb7d0bc71b069da0b5c297f20"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/git/commits/b094ccc5a69b7e9975b38ff8b89852033390a149","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104337442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinrameshn/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinrameshn/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinrameshn/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinrameshn/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/sachinrameshn","id":104337442,"login":"sachinrameshn","node_id":"U_kgDOBjgQIg","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinrameshn/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinrameshn/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinrameshn/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinrameshn/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinrameshn/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/sachinrameshn","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovh/manager/commit/b094ccc5a69b7e9975b38ff8b89852033390a149","node_id":"C_kwDOCUKdX9oAKGIwOTRjY2M1YTY5YjdlOTk3NWIzOGZmOGI4OTg1MjAzMzM5MGExNDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovh/manager/commit/d850f6f66bb924d2b05bcaa48af3343c39656b57","sha":"d850f6f66bb924d2b05bcaa48af3343c39656b57","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/commits/d850f6f66bb924d2b05bcaa48af3343c39656b57"}],"sha":"b094ccc5a69b7e9975b38ff8b89852033390a149","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/commits/b094ccc5a69b7e9975b38ff8b89852033390a149"},{"author":null,"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/commits/d850f6f66bb924d2b05bcaa48af3343c39656b57/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-25T15:13:46Z","email":"jonathan.malnuit@ovhcloud.com","name":"jmalnuit"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T07:03:28Z","email":"104337442+sachinrameshn@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sachin Ramesh"},"message":"feat(container): replace navigation switch with a dropdown\n\nThe two radio buttons used to switch between the classic and the beta\nnavigation are replaced by a single ODS select. It shows the navigation\ncurrently in use and triggers the same tracking event and preference\nupdate as before. Choosing the option that is already active does\nnothing, which avoids a reload if the select emits a change on mount.\n\nThe beta navigation is renamed ''Alternative navigation'' in every\nlocale.\n\nThe component spec now checks for the select and its two options\ninstead of the radios.\n\nref: #MANAGER-22663\nSigned-off-by: Jonathan Malnuit <jonathan.malnuit@ovhcloud.com>","tree":{"sha":"8354608dee0f0b732ec260c5e313506b78b9163e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/git/trees/8354608dee0f0b732ec260c5e313506b78b9163e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/git/commits/d850f6f66bb924d2b05bcaa48af3343c39656b57","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/104337442?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.