ps://api.github.com/users/Alexis-ovhtest/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexis-ovhtest/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexis-ovhtest/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexis-ovhtest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexis-ovhtest/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexis-ovhtest","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/commits/8a49041b9bc58d2e60d0c2465a69cea31df97c22/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-28T16:55:39Z","email":"alexis.afonso@ovhcloud.com","name":"Alexis AFONSO"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-30T07:03:28Z","email":"104337442+sachinrameshn@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Sachin Ramesh"},"message":"build(hub): pin @types/react and @types/react-dom\n\nThe hub declared no React types and borrowed the ones hoisted at the\nmonorepo root. Without a lockfile, the CI pnpm install of the hub pulls\n@types/react 19.3.0 for its third-party packages (ODS, react-router-dom,\nmanager-react-shell-client) while the hub sources keep resolving the\n18.x root copy. The two ReactNode definitions diverge on bigint, and\nevery ODS component fails with TS2786 in the hub build.\n\nPin both packages to the versions used by the container, which builds\nin the same CI run. They are listed in the manager-pm critical\ndependencies, but the PNPM migration only pins the ones an app already\ndeclares, so the hub was left out.\n\nRef: #MANAGER-22282\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dd18380c9283a1808faa6e3c0866c859aeb7a39e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/git/trees/dd18380c9283a1808faa6e3c0866c859aeb7a39e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/git/commits/8a49041b9bc58d2e60d0c2465a69cea31df97c22","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified