b-ovh","id":143193840,"login":"kb-ovh","node_id":"U_kgDOCIj28A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovh/manager/commit/87afe7e57a914e0f12225eab33f3582c3913ae43","node_id":"C_kwDOCUKdX9oAKDg3YWZlN2U1N2E5MTRlMGYxMjIyNWVhYjMzZjM1ODJjMzkxM2FlNDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovh/manager/commit/4bd4ef0088eb70a1b34daca57d26bd1c45fb2813","sha":"4bd4ef0088eb70a1b34daca57d26bd1c45fb2813","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/commits/4bd4ef0088eb70a1b34daca57d26bd1c45fb2813"}],"sha":"87afe7e57a914e0f12225eab33f3582c3913ae43","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/commits/87afe7e57a914e0f12225eab33f3582c3913ae43"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143193840?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kb-ovh","id":143193840,"login":"kb-ovh","node_id":"U_kgDOCIj28A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/commits/4bd4ef0088eb70a1b34daca57d26bd1c45fb2813/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T13:33:44Z","email":"kylian.bainvel@ovhcloud.com","name":"Kylian Bainvel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T08:02:05Z","email":"kylian.bainvel@ovhcloud.com","name":"Kylian Bainvel"},"message":"fix(web-domains): pin @tanstack/react-query\n\nweb-domains was the only app declaring react-query as a caret range\n(^5.90.2). The CI installs with `pnpm install --no-lockfile`, so the range\nresolved to the latest release at build time: 5.102.0 dropped `promise`\nfrom QueryObserverBaseResult and tsc started failing on a mock that was\nwritten against 5.90.x:\n\n  serviceList.spec.tsx(83,7): error TS2353: Object literal may only\n  specify known properties, and ''promise'' does not exist in type\n  ''... & InfiniteQueryObserverSuccessResult<...>''\n\nPin react-query to 5.90.12 and the devtools to 5.91.1, the exact versions\nthe other apps already use.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Kylian Bainvel <kylian.bainvel@ovhcloud.com>","tree":{"sha":"9293176773391d65430e2872fe3db03331ec371e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/git/trees/9293176773391d65430e2872fe3db03331ec371e"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/git/commits/4bd4ef0088eb70a1b34daca57d26bd1c45fb2813","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143193840?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kb-ovh","id":143193840,"login":"kb-ovh","node_id":"U_kgDOCIj28A","organiza