6f20dfc445daaef974f735619d06864/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-17T11:21:05Z","email":"kylian.bainvel@ovhcloud.com","name":"Kylian Bainvel"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-21T08:02:05Z","email":"kylian.bainvel@ovhcloud.com","name":"Kylian Bainvel"},"message":"fix(web-domains): do not submit empty contact fields\n\nbuildSubmitBody started from the whole contact and overwrote every field\nlisted in the configuration rule, including the ones hidden because they\nare not applicable to the extension. resolveFormValue turns null into '''',\nso updating the owner of a .eu domain sent nationality as an empty string\nand the API answered [owner.nationality] \"\" does not match the enum.\n\nSkip the fields that have no value, like the legacy AngularJS controller\nwhich only merged the fields actually rendered in the form.\n\nref: #INC0254501\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 (1M context) <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Kylian Bainvel <kylian.bainvel@ovhcloud.com>","tree":{"sha":"453e6e575cfe8385da4cf4c6d558fede592ca580","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/git/trees/453e6e575cfe8385da4cf4c6d558fede592ca580"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/git/commits/d45e205a06f20dfc445daaef974f735619d06864","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/143193840?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/kb-ovh","id":143193840,"login":"kb-ovh","node_id":"U_kgDOCIj28A","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/kb-ovh/received_events","repos_url":"https: