://api.github.com/users/aottr/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/aottr","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ovh/manager/commit/7a79562d391d57a38d5eee07b5bde0486e2e5bcc","node_id":"C_kwDOCUKdX9oAKDdhNzk1NjJkMzkxZDU3YTM4ZDVlZWUwN2I1YmRlMDQ4NmUyZTViY2M","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ovh/manager/commit/6aa110027078622401f698ccf50c990dff7f163c","sha":"6aa110027078622401f698ccf50c990dff7f163c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/commits/6aa110027078622401f698ccf50c990dff7f163c"}],"sha":"7a79562d391d57a38d5eee07b5bde0486e2e5bcc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/commits/7a79562d391d57a38d5eee07b5bde0486e2e5bcc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/194817708?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexis-ovhtest/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexis-ovhtest/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexis-ovhtest/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexis-ovhtest/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Alexis-ovhtest","id":194817708,"login":"Alexis-ovhtest","node_id":"U_kgDOC5yurA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexis-ovhtest/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexis-ovhtest/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexis-ovhtest/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexis-ovhtest/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexis-ovhtest/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexis-ovhtest","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/commits/6aa110027078622401f698ccf50c990dff7f163c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-25T09:57:16Z","email":"alexis.afonso@ovhcloud.com","name":"Alexis AFONSO"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T14:02:35Z","email":"alex@shorkbytes.com","name":"A.Ottr"},"message":"feat(account): show the company information modal on an invalid SIRET\n\nThe modal only reached mainland FR corporations the API had already flagged\nwith an e-invoicing certificate. Corporations whose SIRET is missing or fails\nits checksums now get it too, in mainland France, Guadeloupe, Martinique and\nRéunion — the territories French VAT applies to, which is what an electronic\ninvoice is issued against. The certificate variants widen to the overseas\nterritories as well, Guyane, Mayotte, Saint-Barthélemy and\nSaint-Pierre-et-Miquelon included.\n\nA SIRET is checked as 14 digits carrying two Luhn checksums, one on the SIREN\nand one on the whole number, since the two double different positions. A zeroed\nSIREN is turned away on its own, Luhn letting it through trivially, and La Poste\nkeeps its documented exception.\n\nThe invoices page gets its own, more restrictive modal: it comes up on arrival,\nreturns on every visit until the SIRET is fixed, and the PDF stays out of reach\nmeanwhile — a gate that until now merely checked the field was not empty. While\nthe customer is in the billing application the container modal steps aside,\nleaving that page to it.\n\nTwo things found on the way: the e-invoicing warning component registered itself\nunder its neighbour''s Angular module name, wiping that registration, and the\nbilling module had no test harness, which it now gets from manager-tests-setup.\n\nCopy lands in fr_FR only; the other locales follow through translation.\n\nref: #MANAGER-22233\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nSigned-off-by: Alexis AFONSO <alexis.afonso@ovhcloud.com>","tree":{"sha":"9cc992b6cfced93ce1e740da6c3502d31baa1267","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/git/trees/9cc992b6cfced93ce1e740da6c3502d31baa1267"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ovh/manager/git/commits/6aa110027078622401f698ccf50c990dff7f163c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"